<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">2 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Saula thih hnuah Davida chu Amalek-ho rûn a lo haw a, Davida chu Ziglag khuaa ni hnih a awm hnu chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />heti hi a ni a, a ni thum ni chuan ngai teh, mi pakhat an ṭanhmun ata Saula hnên aṭangin a puante pawt thlêrin a lua lei kai luam hi a lo kal a; tin, Davida hnên a lo thlen chuan leia bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnênah, “Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a; tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Israel mite ṭanhmun aṭangin ka rawn tlân chhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnênah, “Eng angin nge thil a awm le? Min hrilh teh khai,” a ti a. Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Indona ata mite chu an tlânchhia a, mi tam tak chu an tlu a, an thi hlawm a; tin, Saula leh a fapa Jonathana-te pawh an thi ve asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hrilhtu tlangvâl hnênah chuan, “Engtin nge Saula leh a fapa Jonathana chu an thi tih i hriat?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a hrilhtu tlangvâl chuan, “Eng emaw ti tiin Gilboa tlângah chuan ka lo awm hlauh va; tin, ngai teh, Saula chu a fei rinchhana ding ka hmu a; tin, tawlailîrte leh sakawr chung chuang mite chuan an rawn hnaih ta chiam mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a hnung lam a han hawi chuan mi han hmu a, mi han au va. Tin, keiin, ‘Heta hi ka awm e,’ tiin ka chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hnênah, ‘Tu nge i nih?’ mi ti a. Tin, keiin, ‘Amalek mi ka ni,’ tiin ka chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, ‘Ka kiangah hian lo ding la, mi han that teh mai, ka la nung ting a, mangannain mi tlâkbuak ta si a,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, a kiangah chuan ka ding a, chutia tlu tawh dêr hnu chu a dam zo tawh lo rêng rêng ang tih ka hriat avângin ka that ta mai a, a lua lallukhum leh a bâna bânbun chu ka la a, ka pu hnênah hetah hian ka rawn la a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan a silhfênte chu a chelh a, a pawt thlêr ta a; chutiang bawk chuan a hnêna mi awm zawng zawng chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula leh a fapa Jonathana leh Lalpa mite leh Israela chhûngte chu an sûn a, an ṭah a, tlai lam thlengin chaw an nghei a, khandaiha tihhlum an nih tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hrilhtu tlangvâl hnênah chuan, “Khawi lam mi nge i nih?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ram dang mi, Amalek mi fapa ka ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpa hriak thih tiboral tûra a chunga kut thlâk chu engtiziaa hlau lo nge i nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan tlangvâl pakhat a ko va, “Va hnaih la, va that rawh,” a ti a. Tin, a va sât a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnênah, “I thisen chu nangma lû chung ngeiah awm rawh se; nangma ka ngeiin, ‘ Lalpa hriak thih chu ka that a ni,’ tiin a puang si,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan Saula leh a fapa Jonathana chu he ṭah hla hian a ṭah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, thal kah hla chu Juda thlahte zirtîr tûrin a tîr hlawm a, ngai teh, Jasara buah ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Aw Israel, i ropuina chu i hmun sângahte an that a, Mi liante an tlûk tâk hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gath-ah chuan hril suh ula, Askelon kawtthlêrahte chuan puang suh u; Chuti lo chuan, Philistia fanute an lâwm ang a, Serh tan loh fanuho hlimin an au dah rual ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangni Gilboa tlângte u, In chungah dai leh ruah tla suh se, Thilhlan tûrte chhuah hek suh; Chutah chuan mi lian phaw chu mualpho takin an paih si a, Saula phaw, hriak thih loh mi phaw ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thahte thisen aṭang leh mi lian thau aṭangin Jonathana thal chu a lêt lo va, Saula khandaih chu a thlâwnin a lêt ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saula leh Jonathana nun dân chu a duhawmin a mawi a, An thih pawhin an inṭhen lo; Mupuite aiin an chak zâwk a, Sakeibakneite aiin an chak zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangni Israela fanute u, Saula chu ṭah rawh u, Puan sen mawite a bân che u a, In puanahte rangkachaka cheimawinate beltu che u chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Indo lai taka mi liante an lo tlûk tâk mai chu! I hmun sângahte Jonathana an that ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka unaupa Jonathan, I chung thûah hian ka mangang a ni; Ka chungah i ṭha êm êm ṭhîn a, I mi hmangaihna chu a mak a, Hmeichhe hmangaihna a khûm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi liante chu an tlu a, Indona thuamhnawte pawh a boral zo ta!”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chumi hnuah chuan Davida chuan, “Judai rama khawiiah emaw ka han kal ang em?” tiin Lalpa a râwn a. Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Han kal rawh khai,” a ti a. Tin, Davida chuan, “Khawiiah nge ka han kal ang?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Hebron-ah,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu chutah chuan a han kal ta a, a nupuite pahnih, Jezreel mi Ahinoami leh Karmel mi Nabala nupui Abigaili-te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnêna mi awm zawng zawng chu a hruai chho va, mi tin an chhûngkuate ṭheuh nên, Hebron khuaahte chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Juda mite chu an va kal a, Juda mite chunga lal atân Davida chu hriak an thih a. Chutichuan, “Saula phûmtute chu Jabes-gilead mite an ni,” tiin Davida chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Jabes-gilead mite hnênah chuan Davida chuan mi a tîr a, an hnênah, “In pu, in pu Saula chu in khawngaihzia tilanga in lo phûm avângin Lalpa chuan malsâwm che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan in chungah ngilneihna leh thutak lantîr sela; hêng thil in tih avâng hian kei pawhin in ngilneih man chu ka rûl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, in kutte chu lo chak sela, huai takin awm rawh u; in pu Saula chu a thi ta si a, Juda chite chuan an chunga lal atân hriak min thih ta bawk a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Nera fapa Abnera, Saula sipaite hotu chuan, Saula fapa Isbosetha chu Mahanaim-ah a hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gilead chungah te, Asur chungah te, Jezreel chungah te, Ephraim chungah te, Benjamin chungah leh Israel zawng zawng chungahte lalah a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(Saula fapa Isbosetha chu Israel chunga ro a rêl ṭan lai chuan kum sawmli mi a ni a, kum hnih ro a rêl a.) Nimahsela, Juda mite chuan Davida chu an pawm zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davidan Hebron-a Juda chite chunga ro a lo rêlna chu kum sarih leh thla ruk a ni tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Nera fapa Abnera leh Saula fapa Isbosetha chhiahhlawhte chu Mahanaim ata an chhuak a, Gibeon-ah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Zeruii fapa Joaba leh Davida chhiahhlawhte chu an kal chhuak a, Gibeon dîlah chuan an intâwk a; tichuan, pâwl khat chu dîl râl lehlamah an ṭhu a, pâwl khat chu dîl râl lehlamah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Abnera chuan Joaba hnênah, “Tlangvâlte chu lo thawk sela, kan hmaah han inbei teh rêng ang hmiang,” a ti a. Tin, Joaba chuan, “Lo thawk ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, an thawk a, a zât chin ruat chiahin an kai phei a, Benjamin chi, Saula fapa Isbosetha lama ṭang sâwm leh pahnih; tin, Davida chhiahhlawh sâwm leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An khingpuite chu an lû ṭheuhvah an inman a, mahni bitumate chu khandaihin an nâkah an inchhun ṭheuh va; tichuan, an tlu za ta vek mai a. Chuvângin, chumi hmun chu Helkath-hazurim an ti ta a, chu chu Gibeon-a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi nia an inbei chu a nasa ta hle mai a; tin, Abnera leh Israel mite chu Davida chhiahhlawhte lakah chuan an tlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan Zeruii fapate pathum: Joaba te, Abisaia te, Asahela te an awm a; Asahela chu zukpui ang maia ngalchak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Asahela chuan Abnera chu a ûm a; Abnera a ûm chu ding lam leh vei lama pêng hauh lovin a ûm ngat ngat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abnera chu a han lehhawi a, “Nang i ni maw, Asahel?” a han ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Keimah ka ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Abnera chuan a hnênah, “I ding lamah emaw, i vei lamah emaw khân pêng la, tlangvâl pakhat kha man la, a inrâlthuamna lâksak rawh,” a ti a. Nimahsela, Asahela chuan amah a ûm chu a pênsan duh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Abnera chuan Asahela hnênah, “Mi pênsan rawh. Engah nge ka chhun thlûk ang che? I unaupa Joaba hmêl ka hmu ngam dâwn em ni?” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, a pêng duh chuang lo va; chuvângin, Abnera chuan a fei chhawr lamin a pumah a chhun a, fei chu a hnung lamah a tlang a, chutah chuan a tlu ta tawp a, chumi hmunah chuan a thi ta a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, Asahela a tlûka a thihna hmun lo thleng apiang chu chutah chuan an ding chawt zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joaba leh Abisaia chuan Abnera chu an ûm zêl a; tin, Gibeon thlalêr kawnga Gia dep Amma tlâng an thlen chuan ni a tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte chu Abnera hnênah an pung khâwm a, pawl khatah an insiam a, tlâng chhîpah an va ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abnera chuan Joaba a au va, “Khandaihin a sâm reng dâwn em ni ang? A tâwp lamah chuan a la lungngaihthlâk hle dâwn tih i hre lo vem ni? Eng chen nge mipuite chu an unaute ûm tawh lo tûra i hrilh dâwn le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan, “Pathian nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, eng mah han sawi lo la chu naktûk zîng thlengin ka miten an ûm dâwn che u asin le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chuan tawtawrâwt chu a han hâm a, mipuite chu an ding ta ṭhup mai a, Israel mite chu an ûm ta lo va, an bei leh ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, Abnera leh a mite chu Araba kal tlangin chumi zân chuan an kal zankhua a, Jordan an kân a, Bithron an kal tlang zak a; Mahanaim an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan Abnera a ûm chu a kîrsan ta a. Tin, mipui zawng zawng a han khâwm vek chuan Davida hote sâwm leh pakua leh Asahela an lo kim ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Davida hote erawh chuan Benjamin mite leh Abnera mite chu zathum leh sawmruk an tihlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, Asahela ruang chu an la a, Bethlehem-a a pa thlânah an phûm a. Tin, Joaba leh a mite chu zankhuain an kal a, Hebron an thlenin khua a vâr a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula chhûngte leh Davida chhûngte chu rei tak an indo va; Davida chu a lo chak tial tial a, Saula chhûngte erawh chu an chak lo tial tial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chuan Hebron khuaah chuan fapate a nei a: a fa hmasa ber chu Amnona, Jezreel mi Ahinoami laka mi a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a dawttu chu Kileaba, Karmel mi Nabala nupui Abigaili laka mi a ni; a pathumna chu Absaloma, Gesur lal Talmaia fanu Maaki fapa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a palina chu Adonija, Hagithi fapa a ni a; a pangana chu Sephatia, Abitali fapa a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a parukna chu Ithreama, Davida nupui Ekli laka mi a ni. Hêngte hi Davida fa Hebron-a piangte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Saula chhûngte leh Davida chhûngte an indo chhûng chuan Abnera chu Saula chhûngte zîngah chuan a intichak deuh deuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saula chuan hmei a nei a, a hming chu Rizpi a ni a, Aii fanu a ni. Tin, Isbosetha chuan Abnera hnênah, “Engati nge ka pa hmeinu hnênah i kal?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isbosetha thusawi chuan Abnera chu a tithinur ta hle mai a. “Juda-ho uicho lû mai em ka nih ni? Vawiin thlengin i pa Saula chhûngte leh a unaute leh a ṭhiante chungah ngilneihna ka tilang a, Davida kutah ka hlân lo chia; nimahsela, nangin he hmeichhe chunga sualah hian mi puh ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saula chhûngte lak ata ram chu lâksaka, Israel leh Juda-te chungah Dan aṭanga Beer-seba thlenga Davida lalṭhutthlêng tungding tûra Lalpan Davida hnêna chhia a chham anga ka tih loh chuan, Pathianin Abnera chu a tih tihin ti sela, chu aia nasa pawhin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Abnera chu a hlauh avângin chhân rêng rêng a chhâng ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Abnera chuan a aiah Davida hnênah, “He ram hi tu ta nge ni?” tiin mi a tîr a; tin, “Ka hnênah thu thlung rawh; tichuan, ngai teh, Israel mi zawng zawngte i hnên lama ṭang tûrin ka kut chu i lamah a ṭang ang,” tiin a sawi bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Aw le, i hnênah chuan thu ka thlung ang e; amaherawhchu, i lakah thil pakhat ka phût dâwn a ni: chu chu hei hi a ni, mi hmu tûra i lo kal hunah Saula fanu Mikali i rawn hruai phawt loh chuan ka hmêl i hmu thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Saula fapa Isbosetha hnênah chuan, “Philistia mite serh vun zaa ka lei ka nupui Mikali chu mi rawn pe rawh,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Isbosetha chuan mi a tîr a, a pasal Laisa fapa Paltiela ngei hnên ata chu an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a pasal chu a hnênah a kal a, ṭap chung zêlin a kal a, Bahurim thlengin a zui a. Chutichuan, Abneran a hnênah, “Kal rawh, kîr leh rawh,” a ti a; tin, a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abnera chuan Israel mite upaho chu a bia a, “Tûn hma khân Davida chu in lalah in duh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tûnah hian siam rawh u khai. Lalpan Davida chungchâng thûah chuan, ‘Ka chhiahhlawh Davida kutin ka mi Israel-te chu Philistia mite kut ata leh, an hmêlmate zawng zawng kut ata ka chhan chhuak ang,’ tiin a sawi e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Abnera chuan Benjamin mite beng hriatah a sawi bawk a; tin, Abnera chu Israel mite leh Benjamina chhûng zawng zawngten ṭha an tih ang apiang, Hebron-a Davida beng hriatah sawi tûrin a kal bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abnera chu Hebron-a Davida hnênah mi sawmhnih nên an kal a. Tin, Davida chuan Abnera leh a hnêna mi sawmhnihte tân ruai a ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abnera chuan Davida hnênah, “Ka tho vang a, i hnêna thu an thlun theih nân leh i duhthusâm ang taka ro i rêl theih nân Israel mite zawng zawng ka lalpa hnêna kai khâwm tûrin ka kal tâng e,” a ti a. Tin, Davida chuan Abnera chu a kaltîr a; tichuan, thlamuang takin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Davida mite leh Joaba rammu chu an lo haw a, râllâk sum tam tak an rawn hâwn a; nimahsela, Abnera chu Hebron-a Davida hnênah chuan a lo awm tawh lo, a lo kaltîr tawh si a, ani pawh thlamuang takin a kal ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joaba leh a hnêna mipui zawng zawng an lo thlen chuan, “Nera fapa Abnera chu lal hnênah a lo kal a, ani chuan a kaltîr leh ta a, thlamuang takin a kal ta,” tiin Joaba chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chu lal hnênah a kal a, “I thil lo tih hi eng tizia nge ni le? Ngai teh, Abnera chu i hnênah a lo kal a, engati nge i kal botîra, a kal tawh daih mai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nera fapa Abnera chu i hria a, nangmah tihder tûrin, i chhuak lam leh i lût lam leh i thiltih apiang hriat tumin a lo kal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Davida hnên ata Joaba a lo chhuah chuan Abnera ûm tûrin mi a tîr a, Sira tuichhunchhuah aṭangin an rawn hruai kîr a; nimahsela, Davida chuan a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Abneran Hebron a lo thlen chuan Joaba chuan kulh kawngkhârah biak rûk tûrin a hruai hrang a, a unau Asahela thisen chhuak thungrulh nân a pumah a vit hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, nakina Davidan a han hriat chuan, “Nera fapa Abnera thisen chhuah thûah hian kei leh ka ram chu Lalpa mit hmuhin kan thiang kumkhua ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joaba lû chungah tla sela, a pa chhûngte zawng zawng chungah nên; Joaba chhûngte zîngah chuan thi pût emaw, phâr emaw, tiang rinchhana awm mi emaw, khandaiha thi emaw, ṭâm emaw lo awm lovin awm suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, an unaupa Asahela chu Gibeon-a indonaah a thah avângin, Joaba leh a unau Abisaia chuan Abnera chu an that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Joaba leh a hnêna mipui awm zawng zawngte hnênah chuan, “In puante chu pawt thlêr ula, saiip puan sin ula, Abnera chu sûn rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, Davida chuan hlâng chu a zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Abnera chu Hebron-ah chuan an phûm a; lal chuan a aw a chhuah a, Abnera thlânah chuan a ṭap ta a, mipui zawng zawng pawh an ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Abnera chu a ṭah a, “Abnera chu mi â thihin a thi dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I kut chu phuar a ni lo va, i ke chu kawl bun a ni hek lo, Mi suaksual fate hmaa mi a tlu anga i tlûk tâk mai le?” a ti a. Tin, mi zawng zawng chuan an ṭah leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, chhûn a la nih laiin Davida chu chaw eitîr tûrin mi zawng zawng chu an lo kal a; nimahsela, Davida chuan, “Ni tlâk hmaa chaw emaw, thil dang emaw pawh a eia ka ei hlek chuan Pathianin a tih tihin mi ti rawh se, chu aia nasa pawhin,” tiin chhia a chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chu chu mi zawng zawngin an hriatin an lâwm êm êm a; lal thiltih apiang chuan mipui zawng zawngte chu a tilâwm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipui zawng zawng leh Israel mi zawng zawng chuan, chumi ni chuan Nera fapa Abnera thah chu lal thu a ni lo tih an lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a mite hnênah chuan, “Vawiin hian Israel mi lian, mi ropui tak a thi tih in hre na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lal atâna hriak thih ni mah ila, vawiinah hian ka chak lo a ni; tin, hêng mi, Zeruii fapate hi ka tân tuar an har lutuk a ni. Lalpan thil ṭha lo titua chu a sualzia ang zêlin thungrûl rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Saula fapa Isbosethan Hebron-ah Abnera a thi tih a lo hriat chuan a kutte a lo chak ta lo va; tin, Israel mite zawng zawng chu an zâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Saula fapa Isbosetha chuan sipai pâwl hotu pahnih a nei a: pakhata hming chu Baana a ni a, a danga hming chu Rekaba a ni. Benjamina thlah Beeroth mi Rimona fapate an ni a. (Beeroth chu Benjamina rama ngaih a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Beeroth khuaa mite chu Gitaim-ah an tlân a, tûn thlengin chutah chuan an awm ta a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Saula fapa Jonathana chuan fapa kebai a nei a. Jezreel aṭanga Saula leh Jonathana chanchin an hriat lai chuan kum nga mi a ni a; tichuan, a enkawltu chuan a pawm a, a tlân bopui a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, tlân bo tûra a hmanhmawhna lamah a thlauh va, a ke a lo bai ta a, a hming chu Mephibosetha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Beeroth mi Rimona fapate Rekaba leh Baana chu an kal a, Isbosetha inah chuan chhûn ni sat vânglai taka a chhûn chawlh lai takin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Buh la tûr ni âwm takin in chhûng lamah chuan an lût a, a pumah an vit a; tin, Rekaba leh a unaupa Baana chu an tlân bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ina an va luha a mutna pindana khuma a mu chu an vit a, an that a, a lû an tan a, a lû chu an la a, Araba kal tlangin zankhuain an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Isbosetha lû chu Hebron-ah Davida hnênah an rawn la a, lal hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, hei, nangmah thah tum, i hmêlma Saula fapa Isbosetha lu; Lalpa chuan ka lalpa phuba chu vawiinah hian Saula leh a thlah lakah a lâksak ta a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Beeroth mi Rimona fapa Rekaba leh a unaupa chu a chhâng a, an hnênah, “ Lalpa , ka manganna zawng zawng ata mi chhandamtu nunna chhâlin ka sawi e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />chanchin ṭha rawn thlena inngaiin, ‘Ngai teh, Saula chu a thi ta,’ tiin mi pakhatin mi rawn hrilh a, ani chu ka man a, Ziglag-ah ka that a; chu chu a Chanchin Ṭha rawn thlen mana ka lo pêk chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi fel, ama in chhûng luma, a khumlaizâwl ngeia mi, mi sualin an thah thisen man chu in lakah ka phût lehzualin, leilung ata hi ka va tibo dâwn tehlul che u êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan a tlangvâlte chu thu a pe a, anni chuan an that a, an kut leh an ke an tansak a, Hebron-a dîl kamah chuan an khai a. Isbosetha lû erawh chu an la a, Hebron-a Abnera thlânah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel chi zawng zawng chu Hebron-a Davida hnênah an lo kal a, “Ngai teh, i thisen zawmpui kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûn hmaa Saula kan chunga a lal laia Israel-te hruai chhuak leh hruai lûttu i ni ṭhîn a; tin, Lalpa chuan i hnênah, ‘Ka mi Israel-te chu i châwm ang a, Israel-te chungah hotuah i awm ang,’ a ti a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel upa zawng zawng chu Hebron-ah lal hnênah an kal a; tin, Lal Davida chuan Hebron-ah chuan Lalpa hmaah an hnênah thu a thlung a; tin, Davida chu Israel-te chunga lal atân hriak an thih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida chu a lal tirh lai chuan kum sawmthum mi a ni a, kum sawmli a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hebron-ah chuan Juda-te chungah kum sarih leh thla ruk a lal a; tin, Jerusalem-ah Israel-te leh Juda-te zawng zawng chungah kum sawmthum leh kum thum a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, lal leh a mite chu chumi rama chêngho Jebus mi rûn tûrin Jerusalem-ah an kal a; chûngho chuan Davida a lo luh theih loh ringin, Davida hnênah, “Hetah hian i lo lût tawp lo vang, mitdel leh kebaiten an lo dang ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Davida chuan Zion kulh chu a la ta mial a, chu chu Davida khua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Davida chuan a hote hnênah, “Jebus-ho khu ka huat ang meuhva thah duh hial khawpa haw ve in awm em? ‘Mitdel leh kebaiho khua’ bei tûrin lui luanna zuiin luhkhung rawh se,” a ti a. Chuvâng alâwm, “Mitdel leh kebaite chu Lalpa inah an lût tûr a ni lo,” tih a nih tâk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu kulhah chuan a awm a, Davida khua a vuah ta a. Tin, Davida chuan Milo aṭangin a vêlin kulh a siam a, a chhûng lamah nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu a lo ropui ta deuh deuh va, Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian chu a hnêna a awm zêl avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Tura lal Hiraman Davida hnênah mi a tîr a, sidar thingte a thawn a, themthiamte leh lungchhertute a tîr bawk a, Davida in an saksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Lalpan Israel mite chunga lalah amah chu a tinghet a, a mi Israel-te avângin ram chu a chawimawi a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Hebron a chhuahsan hnuah Jerusalem-a mi hmei leh nupui a neih belhchhah a. Tichuan, Davida chuan fapate leh fanute a la nei leh cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-a a neih hmingte chu hêng hi an ni: Samua te, Sobaba te, Nathana te, Solomona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ibhara te, Elisua te, Nephega te, Japhia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisama te, Eliada te, Elipheleta te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu Israel mite lal atân hriak an thih tih Philistia miten an hriatin, Philistia mi zawng zawng chu Davida zawng tûrin an chho ta a; tin, Davida chuan a lo hria a, kulhbîngah a chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chu Rephaim ruamah an inzâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Philistia mite bei tûrin ka han chho vang em? Ka kutah hian anniho chu i pe dâwn em?” tiin Lalpa a râwn a. Tin, Lalpa chuan Davida hnênah, “Han chho rawh; Philistia mite chu i kutah ka pe ngei ngei dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu Baal-perazim-ah a kal a, chutah chuan Davidan anniho chu a bei a, “ Lalpan ka hmêlmate chu tuikhuah sah ang maiin ka hmaah min tihdarhsak ta,” a ti a. Chuvângin, chumi hmun hmingah chuan Baal-perazim a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan an milemte an kalsan a, Davida leh a mite chuan an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chu an chho leh a, Rephaim ruamah an inzâr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Lalpa a han râwn chuan, ani chuan, “Han chho suh; an hnung lamah kal hual la, thingtheihmu kûng zâwnahte han bei rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, thingtheihmu lêra kal thâwm ang ri ṭhup ṭhup i hriat chuan, che rawh! Philistia sipaite bei tûrin i hmaah Lalpa a chhuak ta tihna a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan thu a pêk angin Davida chuan a ti a; Philistia mite chu Geba aṭangin Gezer thlengin a bei a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Israel mite zînga mi thlan ṭhiau sîngthum a khâwm leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a tho va, Judai rama Baale khua aṭangin, cherub-te chunga chuang sipaihote Lalpa hming an puttîr Pathian bâwm chu la chho tûrin, a hnêna mi awm zawng zawngte nên chuan an thawk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Pathian bâwm chu tawlailîr tharah an dah a, tlânga Abinadaba in ata an la chhuak a; Abinadaba fapa Uza leh Ahiova-te chuan tawlailîr thar chu an khalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, tlânga Abinadaba in ata chu Pathian bâwm chawpin an la chhuak a; Ahiova chu Pathian bâwm hma lamah chuan a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Davida leh Israel mi zawng zawngte chuan Lalpa hmaah chuan thil ri thei chi hrang hrang - fâr thinga siam leh ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te, khuangtê te, tawtawrâwt bi nei te, dârbenthek te an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Nakona hruih zâwl an thlen chuan Uza chuan Pathian bâwm chu a han ban a, a chelh a; sebâwng chu a pai a pai avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thin chu Uza chungah chuan a ur ta thut a, a thiltih dik loh avâng chuan Pathianin chutah chuan a tihlum a, Pathian bâwm kiangah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu Uza chunga a ṭuan tâk avângin Davida chu a thinur a, chumi hmun chu Perez-uza a vuah a, tûn thleng hian a la ni ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan Davida chuan Lalpa chu a hlau va; “Engtin nge Lalpa bâwm chu ka hnên a lo thlen theih tâk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Lalpa bâwm chu Davida khuaa ama hnênah chuan a suan duh ta lo va; Davida chuan Git mi Obed-edoma in lamah a dah ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa bâwm chu Git mi Obed-edoma inah chuan thla thum a awm a; tichuan, Obed-edoma leh a chhûngte zawng zawng chu Lalpan mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lal Davida chu, “Pathian bâwm avângin Obed-edoma chhûngkua leh a in leh lo zawng zawng Lalpan mal a sâwm a ni,” tiin an hrilh a. Tichuan, Davida chuan Pathian bâwm chu Obed-edoma in ata Davida khuaah chuan lâwm takin a zuk la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lalpa bâwm zâwntute chu pên ruk an kal veleh sebâwngpa leh ran châwm thauvin an inthawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a theihtâwpin Lalpa hmaah a lâm a, Davida chuan puanzaisîn puithiam kawr a ha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh Israel mi zawng zawngte chuan au dur dur chung leh tawtawrâwt hâm ruai ruai chungin Lalpa bâwm chu an la chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lalpa bâwm chu Davida khuaa a luh lai chuan Saula fanu Mikali chuan tukverh aṭangin a lo thlîr a, Lalpa hmaa Davida zuang leh lâm chu a hmu a, a hmusit rilru ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa bâwm chu an la lût a, a dahna tûra Davidan a zâr, puan in chhûnga a hmun tûrah chuan an dah ta a; tin, Davida chuan hâlral thilhlante leh remna thilhlante Lalpa hmaah chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Davidan hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlante chu a hlan zawh chuan Sipaihote Lalpa hmingin mipuite chu mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawng, Israel pum puite chu a hmei a pain mi tin, chhang hlâwm khat leh sa hrang khat leh grêp rah pho ro bâwr khat a sem ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi zawng zawng mahni in lam ṭheuhvah an haw ta a. Chutichuan, Davida chu a chhûngte malsâwm tûrin a haw leh ta a. Tin, Saula fanu Mikali chu Davida hmuak tûrin a lo chhuak a, “Vawiina Israel lal chu a va ropui ve le, mi ho tak, zah nachâng hre lo, saruaka awm ang maiin vawiinah a chhiahhlawh nulate mit hmuhah saruakin a awm kha le!” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Mikali hnênah chuan, “I pa leh a chhûngte zawng zawng aia mi thlanga, Lalpa mi, Israel-te chunga lala mi ruattu Lalpa hmaah asin. Lalpa hmaah chuan lâm âwm rêng ka ni alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng ai mah hian ka la zahpuiawm ang, keimah pawh ka la insit cheu vang; amaherawhchu, chûng chhiahhlawh nula i sawite chawimawi chuan ka awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula fanu Mikali chuan a thih thlengin fa a nei lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti a ni a, lal chu a ina a awma, Lalpan an vêla a hmêlmate zawng zawng laka râlmuanga a awmtîr hnu chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />lal chuan zâwlnei Nathana hnênah, “Hei, kei chu sidar thing inah ka awm a; nimahsela, Pathian bâwm chu puan in maiah a awm a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Nathana chuan lal hnênah, “I rilrua awm ang tak chuan va ti rawh, Lalpa i hnênah a awm alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti a ni a, chumi zân vêk chuan Nathana hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh Davida chu va hrilh rawh, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ka awmna tûrin nangin in min saksak dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israela thlahte Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah aṭangin tûn thlengin inah ka awm lo va, puan inah leh biak bûkah ka awm zêl zâwk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israela thlahte zînga ka kalna zawng zawngah pawh, ka mi Israel-te châwm tûra thu ka pêk rorêltute hnênah, “Engati nge sidar thingin in min saksak loh?” tiin ka sawi ngai em ni?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka chhiahhlawh Davida hnênah, ‘Sipaite Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Berâm tlatna hmun ata i berâm vêng lai chu ka mi Israel-te chunga hotu atân ka la chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, i kalna apiangah i hnênah ka awm zêl a, i hmaah chuan i hmêlmate ka tibo zêl a; leia mi ropui takte hming ang hming ropui tak ka siam che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu bâkah chuan, ka mi Israel-te tân hmun ka ruat ang a, anmahni pual hmunah an awma, an insuan tawh loh nân anni chu ka phun ang a; tûn hma ang khân suahsualna faten an tirethei tawh lo vang a, ka mi Israel-te chunga rorêltute ka ruat lai ang kha a ni tawh hek lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tin, i hmêlma zawng zawng lak ata hi ka chawlhtîr ang che. Tin, chu lo rêngah pawh, Lalpan chhûngkua chu a dinsak ang che tih a hrilh bawk che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I ni a kina i pute hnêna i mut hunah chuan, i hnua i thlah, i rîla rah tûr chu ka tungding ang a, a ram chu ka tinghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan ka hming atân in a sa ang a; tin, a ram lalṭhutthlêng chu kumkhua atân ka tinghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A Pa ka ni ang a, ani chu ka fapa a ni ang a. Thil a tihsual chuan, mihring tiang leh mihring fate vuaknain ka thunun ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, i hmaa ka sawn bo Saula hnên ata ka lâk bo ang khân ka zahngaihna chuan ani zawng a kalsan lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, i chhûngkua leh i ram chu chatuana tihngheh tlat a ni ang a, i lalṭhutthlêng chu chatuana tihngheh a ni ang,’ a ti,” tiin Lalpa thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng thu zawng zawng ang zêl leh chu inlârna ang chiah chuan Nathana chuan Davida hnênah a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Davida chu a lût a, Lalpa hmaah chuan a ṭhu a; “Aw Lalpa Pathian, tu nge maw ka niha, ka chhûngte pawh tu nge maw an niha, heti chen chen mi hruai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, chûng pawh chu nanga mit hmuhah chuan thil tê tham mai zawng a ni a; nimahsela, i chhiahhlawh chhûngkaw lo awm dân tûr thu chu kum tam tak chhûng atân i lo sawi tawh bawk a; aw Lalpa PATHIAN, hêngte pawh hi mihringte tih dân ang bawk a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Davida hian i hnênah eng nge a sawi leh chuan ang? I chhiahhlawh hi i hre vek si, aw Lalpa Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hriat tûrin i thu avâng leh nangma thinlung ang zêlin hêng thil ropui tak hi i ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan aw Lalpa Pathian, nang chu i ropui a ni; kan benga kan hriat dânin nangmah ang rêng rêng an awm lo va, nangmah lo chu Pathian rêng rêng an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata leh hnam tin leh an pathiante lak ata i tâna i thlan chhuah, i mite hmaa i tân thil ropui tak leh i ram tâna thil hlauhawm tak ti tûr leh, ama hming ropui tak siam tûra Pathianin ama mite atâna a rawn thlan chhuah, i mi Israel-te ang rêng rêng hi khawvêlah hian hnam dang tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, i mi Israel-te chu chatuana i mite an lo nih theih nân i tân i tinghet ta a; tin, Lalpa , nang chu an Pathian i lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, aw Lalpa Pathian, i chhiahhlawh chungchâng thu leh a chhûngte chungchâng thu i sawi chu chatuan atân tinghet la, i sawi tawh ang khân ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ‘Sipaihote Lalpa chu Israel-te Pathian a ni,’ tiin, i hming chu chatuana chawimawiin awm rawh se; tichuan, i chhiahhlawh Davida chhûngte chu i hmaah tihnghehin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aw Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, i chhiahhlawh hnênah, ‘Chhûngkua chu ka dinsak ang che,’ tiin i puang tawh si a. Chuvângin, i chhiahhlawh chuan he ṭawngṭaina hi i hnênah a thlen ngam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, Nang chu Pathian i ni a, i thu chu thutak a ni a; tin, he thil ṭha hi i chhiahhlawh hnênah i tiam tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuvângin, i chhiahhlawh chhûngte chu i hmaa chatuana an awm reng theih nân malsâwm ang che; aw Lalpa Pathian, nang chuan i sawi tawh si a; tin, i malsâwmnain i chhiahhlawh chhûngte chu chatuana malsâwmin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, Davida chuan Philistia mite chu a bei a, a hneh a; tichuan, Davida chuan Philistia mite thuneihna bulpui chu a chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Moab mite a bei a, leiah a muttîr a, tehna hruiin a teh a. Tlar hnih chu tihhlum tûrin a teh a, tlar khat chu a tluana nunga zuah tûrin a teh a. Tichuan, Moab mite chu Davida chhiah khua an lo ni ta a, chhiahte an pe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan Luia a ram la leh tûra a kal pahin Zoba lal Rehoba fapa Hadadezera pawh a bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan a sakawr chung chuang mi 1,700 leh sipai 20,000 a mansak a. Davida chuan tawlailîr hnûk mi sakawr zawng zawng chu an tha a chhahsak bawk a, tawlailîr za hnûktu tûr erawh chu a zuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Damaska-a Suria mi, Zoba lal Hadadezera chhan tûra kalte chu Davidan Suria mite zînga mi 22,000 a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Suria rama Damaska-ah chuan sipai a dah a; tichuan, Suria mite chu Davida chhiah khua an lo ni ta a, chhiahte an pe ṭhîn a. Tin, Lalpan Davida chu a kalna apiangah a hnehtîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Hadadezera hote rangkachak phawte a lâksak a, Jerusalem-ah a hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hadadezera khua Beta aṭang te, Berothai aṭangtein Davida chuan dâr tam tak a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Hamath lal Toia chuan Hadadezera sipai zawng zawng Davidan a hneh tih a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hadadezera chu a beiha a hneh avânga chibai bûk tûr leh lâwmpui tûrin Toia chuan a fapa Jorama chu Davida hnênah a tîr a; Hadadezera chuan Toia hi a do ṭhîn si a. Tin, Jorama chuan tangkaraw bêl te, rangkachak bêl te, dâr bêlte a rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûng chu ram dang a ngam zawng zawnga mi tangkarua leh rangkachak a hlante nên chuan Lal Davidan Lalpa hnênah a hlân bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suria-ho ta te, Moab-ho ta te, Amona thlahho ta te, Philistia-ho ta te, Amalek-ho ta te, Zoba lal Rehoba fapa Hadadezera laka a râllâkte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu Chi Ruamah, Suria mi 18,000 a bei haw chu a hming a lo thang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Edom-ah chuan sipai a dah a; Edom ram hmun tinah sipai a dah thluah mai a; tichuan, Edom mi zawng zawng chu Davida chhiah khua an lo ni ta a. Tichuan, Lalpan Davida chu a kalna apiangah a hnehtîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Israel mi zawng zawng chungah ro a rêl a; tin, Davida chuan a mi zawng zawngte chungah chuan fel takin ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba chu sipai hotu ber a ni a; Ahiluda fapa Jehosaphata chu chanchin ziaktu a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahituba fapa Zadoka leh Abiathara fapa Ahimeleka chu puithiam an ni a; Seria chu ziaktu a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu Kereth mi leh Peleth mite hotu a ni a; tin, Davida fapate chu puithiam an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Jonathana avânga khawngaihna ka tihlan theihna tûrin Saula chhûngte zînga mi awm an la awm em aw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Saula chhûngte chhiahhlawh pakhat a hming Ziba a awm a, Davida hnêna kal tûrin an ko va. Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Ziba i ni em?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ni e, kei i chhiahhlawhpa hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Pathian khawngaihna ka tihlan theihna tûrin Saula chhûngte zînga mi an la awm lâwm ni le?” a ti a. Tin, Ziba chuan lal hnênah, “Jonathana chuan fapa pakhat a la nei a, a ke pawh a bai nghe nghe,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Khawiah nge a awm?” a ti a. Tin, Ziba chuan lal hnênah, “Ngai teh, Lo-debar-ah Amiela fapa Makira inah a awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Davida chuan mi a tîr a, Lo-debar ata Amiela fapa Makira ina mi chu an va hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Saula fa Jonathana fapa Mephibosetha chu Davida hnênah chuan a lo kal a, a hmaia lei siin chibai a bûk a. Tin, Davida chuan, “Mephiboseth,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “En teh, i chhiahhlawh hi,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnênah, “Hlau suh, i pa Jonathana avângin ka khawngaih ngei ngei ang chia, i pu Saula ram zawng zawng ka neihtîr leh ang chia, ka dawhkânah chaw i kîl ve fo tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chibai a bûk a, “Kei, ui thisâwn ang mai, i chhiahhlawh hi eng nge maw a niha i ngaihsak ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan Saula chhiahhlawh Ziba chu a ko va, a hnênah, “Saula thil zawng zawng leh a chhûngte zawng zawng thilte chu i pu fapa hi ka pe vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a tân lei i lehsak ang a, nang leh i fapate leh i chhiahhlawhte nên; tin, i pu fapa chuan ei tûrte a neih theih nân i thawh chhuahte chu i rawn la ang a; i pu fapa Mephibosetha erawh hi chuan ka dawhkânah chaw a kîl fo vang,” a ti a. Ziba chuan fapa sâwm leh panga leh chhiahhlawh sawmhnih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ziba chuan lal hnênah, “Ka lal, ka puin a chhiahhlawh thu a pêk ang zêlin i chhiahhlawh hian a ti ang,” a ti a. Lal chuan, “Mephibosetha zawngin ka dawhkânah lal fapa ang bawkin chaw a kîl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mephibosetha chuan fapa naupang a nei a, a hming chu Mika a ni. Tin, Ziba ina awm zawng zawng chu Mephibosetha chhiahhlawh an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mephibosetha chu Jerusalem-ah a awm ta a, lal dawhkânah chaw a kîl ve fo va; a ke khinghnih a bai a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng hnuah chuan Amona thlahte lal chu a thi a, a fapa Hanuna chu a ai awhin a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “A pa chuan mi lo khawngaih angin kei pawhin Nahasa fapa Hanuna chu ka khawngaih ve ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Davida chuan a pa chungchâng thûa thlamuan tûrin ama mite a tîr a. Tin, Davida mite chuan Amona thlahte ram an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Amona thlahte puipaho chuan an pu Hanuna hnênah chuan, “Davida hian i pa a zah avângin i hnênah thlamuantu a rawn tîr niin i ring em ni? Davida hian a mite hi khuate rawn tichhe tûra thlîthlai leh enthla tûrin i hnênah a rawn tîr a ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hanuna chuan Davida mite chu a man a, an khabe hmul khingkhat a mehsak a; tin, an silhfênte chu a lai takah an mawng thleng pha chauhvin a tansak a, a kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Davida an han hrilh chuan, a hmuak tûrin mi a tîr a; anni chu an zak hle mai si a. Tin, lal chuan, “In khabe hmul a chawr sei hma chu Jeriko-ah awm rih ula, chumi hnuah chuan in lo haw a ni ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahten Davida huat zâwng an lo ni ta tih an inhriat chuan, Amona thlahte chuan Beth-rehob-a mi Suria-ho leh Zoba-a mi Suria-ho sipai sînghnih leh, lal Maaka, a mi sângkhat nên, Tob mite sîngkhat leh sânghnih nên an chah a, an ruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Davidan chu chu a hriatin Joaba leh sipai huaisen zawng zawngte a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahte chu an lo chhuak a, khaw luhna kawngkhâr lamah chuan ṭanhmun an siam a; tin, Zoba-a mi leh Rehob-a mi Suria-hote leh Toba leh Maaka hote erawh chu a hrangin phûlah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, an hma lam leh an hnung lamah an rawn bei dâwn tih Joaban a hriatin Israel mite zînga mi a ṭha ṭha a thlang chhuak a, Suria mite bei tûrin ṭanhmun a lo siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mi dang zawng zawng chu a unaupa Abisaia kutah a dah vek a, Amona thlahte bei tûrin ṭanhmun a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Suria mite hi ka chelh dâwn loh chuan nangin min pui ang a; tin, nangin Amona thlahte i chelh dâwn loh chuan ka rawn pui ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai takin awm la, kan mite leh kan Pathian khaw chhanin i intipachang ang u; tin, Lalpa chuan ṭha a tih ang zêlin ti rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba leh a hnêna mite chuan Suria mite bei tûrin indona hmun lam chu an va hnaih a; tin, a hmaah chuan an tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahten Suria mite an tlânchhia tih an hriat chuan, anni pawh chu Abisaia hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ve ta a, khuaah chuan an lût a. Tin, Joaba chuan Amona thlahte chu a kîrsan a, Jerusalem-ah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Suria miten Israel-te hmaah an chan a chhe ta tih an lo hriat chuan an inpun khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Hadarezera chuan mi a tîr a, Lui piah lama Suria mite chu a hruai chhuak a, Hadarezera sipai hotu Sobaka chuan hma a hruai a; Helam-ah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chu chu Davida an hrilh a; tin, ani chuan Israel mi zawng zawng a ko khâwm a, Jordan lui an kai a, Helam-ah chuan an kal a. Tin, Suria mite chuan Davida do tûr chuan ṭanhmun an lo siam a, an lo bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Suria mite chu Israel-te hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ta a; tin, Davida chuan Suria mi tawlailîr zasarih chunga chuang leh sakawr chung chuang mi sîngli a that a; tin, an sipai hotu Sobaka pawh a that a, chutah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hadarezera chhiahhlawha awm lal zawng zawngten Israel-te hmaah an chan a chhe ta tih an lo hriat chuan Israel-te nêna inremna an siam a, an chhiahhlawhah an awm ta a. Chutichuan, Suria mite chuan Amona thlahte chu an pui leh ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum a lo veia, lalte indo tûra an chhuah ṭhin lai hun chuan Davidan Joaba chu a tîr a, a mite leh Israel mi zawng zawngte nên; tin, Amona thlahte chu an tiboral a, Raba khua an hual a, Davida erawh chu Jerusalem-ah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, tlai nêmah chuan a khum ata Davida chu a tho va, lal in chungah a han kal a; tin, in chung aṭang chuan hmeichhe pakhat inbual lai hi a han hmu a; chu hmeichhia chu hmêl ṭha tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan mi a tîr a, chu hmeichhe chanchin chu a zawh fiahtîr a. Tin, “Eliama fanu, Bathsebi, Hit mi Uria nupui a ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan mi a tîr a, an hruai ta a; tin, a hnên chu a va thleng a, a lo mutpui ta a (a fel loh loh lai tak a ni a); tin, a in lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, hmeichhia chu a lo rai ta a; tin, “Nau ka pai ta,” tiin Davida chu a hrilhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Joaba hnênah, “Hit mi Uria chu ka hnênah han kaltîr rawh,” tiin a chah a. Tin, Joaba chuan Uria chu Davida hnênah a kaltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Urian a hnên a han thlen chuan, Davida chuan Joaba leh mite chu eng nge an ana, indonaahte eng nge an an tih a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Uria hnênah, “I in lamah haw la, i kete zuk sil rawh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Uria chu lal in ata chu a chhuak a; tin, lal chuan ei tûrtein a ûm zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Uria chu a pu chhiahhlawhhote zîngah lal in kawngkhâr bulah chuan a mu ve ta mai a, a in lamah chuan a haw ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu, “Uria chu a in lamah a haw lo,” tiin an han hrilh veleh chuan Davidan Uria hnênah, “Khawilo ni hâwng i ni lâwm ni? Engati nge i in lamah i hâwn loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Uria chuan Davida hnênah, “Pathian bâwm te, Israel-te leh Juda-te chu bûkah an awm a; tin, ka pu Joaba leh ka pu mite chu ramhnuaiah an inkulh a; kei ka inah hâwngin ka eiin ka in ang a, ka nupui hnênah ka mu bîk ang maw? I nunna leh i thlarau nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, chu chu ka ti lo tawp ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Uria hnênah, “Vawiinah pawh hetah awm la, naktûkah i kal dâwn nia,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Uria chu Jerusalem-ah chuan chumi ni leh a tûkah pawh chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a ko va, a hmaah chuan a eiin a in a, a tirui ta dêr mai a; tin, tlai lamah chuan a in lamah haw lovin a pu chhiahhlawhte zîngah mu tûr chuan a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûk zîngah chuan Davida chuan Joaba chu lehkha a thawn a, Uria chu a kentîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaah chuan, “Uria chu râl zualna lai berah hmatâwntîr ula, an thaha a thih hlauh nân thlahthlam rawh u,” tiin a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Joaban khua chu a hual vêl lai chuan mi huai huai awmna nia a hriatah chuan Uria chu a ṭantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, khuaa mite chu an chhuak a, Joaba chu an bei a, mi ṭhenkhat, Davida mite zînga mi ngei chu an thi a; tin, Hit mi Uria pawh a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chuan mi a tîr a, indo chungchâng thu lam zawng zawng chu Davida a hrilh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, a mi tirh chu, “Lal hnêna indo chanchin zawng zawng i sawi zawha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a thin a ur thut mai a, ‘Engati nge bei tûra chutianga khaw bul lawka in kal mai? Kulh aṭangin an kâp mai ang che u tih in hre lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerubesetha fapa Abimeleka kha tuin nge that kha? Buh râwt sawmna lung chungnung zâwk, hmeichhiain kulh aṭangin a chungah a zuk thlâk a. Thebez-ah khân a thi a ni lâwm ni? Engati nge chutianga kulh bul lawka in kal ni?’ a tih chuan, ‘I chhiahhlawh Hit mi Uria pawh kha a thi asin,’ ti ang che,” tiin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, a mi tirh chu a kal ta a, a va thleng a, Joaban a tirh chhan zawng zawng chu Davida a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a mi tirh chuan Davida hnênah, “Mite chuan min rawn nawr a, phûlah min rawn bei a; tin, keinin an khaw luhna kawngkhâr thleng rawkin kan nawr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, kâptute chuan kulh aṭangin i chhiahhlawhte chu an kâp a; tichuan, lal chhiahhlawh ṭhenkhatte an thi a; tin, i chhiahhlawh Hit mi Uria pawh kha a thi asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan a mi tirh hnênah chuan, “Joaba hnênah chuan heti hian va ti rawh, ‘Hêng hian i rilru tilâwm lo chuang suh se, khandaih chuan a tua mah a thlei si lo; nasa lehzualin khua chu bei ula, tichhe rawh u,’ tiin fuih rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Uria nupui chuan a pasal Uria a thi tih a lo hriat chuan a pasal chu a sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a sûn hun bi a pelh hnu chuan Davida chuan a in lamah a hruaitîr a, a nupuiah a nei ta a, fapa a hrinsak a. Nimahsela, Davida thiltih chuan Lalpa a tilungni lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Davida hnênah Nathana a tîr a. Tin, a hnênah chuan a kal a, “Khaw pakhatah hian mi pahnih an awm a: pakhat chu mi hausa a ni a, pakhat chu mi rethei a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi hausa chuan berâm rual tam tak leh ran rual tam tak a nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mi rethei erawh chuan berâmno, a nu, tê tak tê a lei, a vulh pakhat chauh lo chu eng mah a nei lo va; a hnênah a fate nêna ṭhang lian a ni a. A thlêng zenpui leh a no ṭâwmpui, a ângchhûnga awm, a fanu ang chiaha a ngaih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, mi hausa hnênah chuan khualzin pakhat hi a va thleng a; tin, a hnêna mikhual lo thleng chu ama berâm leh ran chu talh phal lovin, mi rethei berâmno chu a chhuhsak a, a hnêna lo kal pa chu a talh a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu chu mi chungah chuan a thinur ta viau mai a; Nathana hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, chu thil titu chu tihhlum mai tlâk a nih chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hetiang thil a tih avâng leh khawngaihna a neih loh avângin a berâmno chu a leh liin a rul tûr a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Nathana chuan Davida hnênah, “Nangmah hi i ni alâwm! Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Israel-te lal atân hriak ka thih chia, Saula kut ata ka chhan chhuak chia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, i pu in ro chu ka luahtîr chia, i pu nupuite chu i ângchhûngah ka dah a; tin, Israela chhûngte leh Juda chhûngte chu ka pe chia; tin, chûng chu a la tlêm luattuk chuan thil dangte pawh ka pêk belh tûr che alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engati nge Lalpa thu chu ngainêpa, a mit hmuha thil ṭha lo i tih mai? Hit mi Uria chu khandaihin i tihlum a, a nupui chu i nupui atân i neihsak a, Amona thlahte khandaihin ani chu i that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan khandaih chuan i chhûngte chu a kiansan tawp lo vang; nang chuan mi ngainêpin Hit mi Uria nupui chu i nupui atân i chhuhsak ta si a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Ngai teh, nangma chhûngkaw zîng aṭang ngeiin i chungah thil ṭha lo ka chhuahtîr ang a, i mit hmuh ngeiah i nupuite chu ka lâksak ang chia, i vêngte ka pe ang a, chhûn ênah i nupuite an mutpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang chuan a rûkin i ti a, kei erawh chuan Israel mite zawng zawng mit hmuhah chhûn ênah ka ti ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Nathana hnênah, “ Lalpa chungah thil ka tisual ta a ni,” a ti a. Tin, Nathana chuan Davida hnênah, “ Lalpa pawhin i sual chu a dah bo ve ta e; i thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, he i thiltih hian Pathian sawichhiatna remchâng tak Lalpa hmêlmate tân i siam avângin naupang i laka piang chu a thi ngei ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Nathana chuan a in lamah a hâwnsan ta a. Tin, Uria nupuiin Davida a hrinsak chungah chuan Lalpan a kut a thlâk a, a damlo ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davidan naupang tân chuan Pathian hnênah a ngên chiam a; tin, Davida chuan chaw te a nghei a, a lût a, zankhuain leiah a mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a chhûngte zînga upate chu an tho va, lei ata chu kai tho tûrin a kiangah an ding a; nimahsela, a tho duh lo va, an hnênah pawh chaw a ei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a ni sarih ni chuan naupang chu a thi ta a. Tin, Davida chhiahhlawhte chuan naupang chu a thi ta tih hrilh chu an hlau va, “Ngai teh, naupang a la dam lai khân a hnênah thu kan sawi a, a ngaithla duh si lo va, naupang chu a thi ta tih engtin nge kan hrilh ngam ang? Eng emaw tiin a inti mai ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Davidan chutia a chhiahhlawhte inbe ruho a hmuh chuan, Davida chuan naupang chu a thi ta a ni tih a hre ta a; tin, Davida chuan a chhiahhlawhte hnênah, “Naupang chu a thi ta elo?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Thi ta,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu lei ata chu a tho va, a insil a, hriak a inthih a, a puante a inthlâk a; tin, Lalpa inah a kal a, Pathian chibai a bûk a; tin, a in lamah a kal leh a; tin, chaw a han lam a, a hmaah chuan an hlui a, a lo ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, a chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “I thiltih dân hi eng tizia nge ni? Naupang chu a dam lai khân chaw te i nghei a, i ṭap a; nimahsela, naupang chu thi ta chêng a, i tho va, chaw te i ei ta zâwk mai si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Naupang chu a la dam lai khân chaw te ka ngheiin ka ṭap tak a; ‘Naupang chu a dam theih nân Lalpa chuan mi khawngaih mahna, tu nge hria ang i?’ ka ti a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûnah chuan a thi ta si a, engah nge chaw ka nghei tawh ang? Ka ko kîr leh thei dâwn em ni? A hnênah keimah hi ka la kal ang a; nimahsela, ani zawng ka hnênah a lo kîr leh tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan a nupui Bathsebi chu a thlamuan a, a hnênah a lût a, a mutpui a; tin, fapa a hring a, a hmingah Solomona a sa a. Tin, ani chu Lalpan a hmangaih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tin, zâwlnei Nathana chu a chahtîr a; tin, ani chuan Lalpa chawiin a hmingah chuan Jedidia a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chuan Amona thlahte khawpui Raba a rûn a, khawpui chu a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan Davida hnênah mi a tîr a, “Raba chu ka rûn a, a ni, tuite khawpui chu ka la ta asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi la awm zawng zawng chu khâwm la, khawpui chu beih tumin ep la, la rawh; keimahin khawpui chu ka lâk zawngin ka hming a pu mai dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan mi zawng zawng chu a khâwm a, Raba-ah chuan an kal a, an va rûn a, an la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, an lal lallukhum khum lai chu a lâksak a, a rih lam chu rangkachak talent bûk a ni a, lunghlute pawh a tel a; tin, Davida an khumtîr a. Tin, khawpuia mi râllâk sum tam tak a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu a kawi chhuak a, thingzaina te, leilehna thîr zum te, thîr hreipui te hmangin hna an thawhtîr a, leirawhchante an siamtîr a. Amona thlahte khawpui zawng zawng chu chutiang chuan a ti a. Tin, Davida leh mi zawng zawng chu Jerusalem-ah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, Davida fapa Absaloma chuan farnu hmêl ṭha tak a nei a, a hming chu Tamari a ni a. Tin, Davida fapa Amnona chuan ani chu a hmangaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Amnona chu a farnu Tamari avâng chuan a buai ta hle a, a damlo ta a; ani lah chu nula thianghlim a ni si a. A chunga thil eng emaw han tih chu Amnona tân chuan khirh tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Amnona chuan ṭhian a nei a, a hming chu Jonadaba a ni a, Davida unaupa Simea fapa a ni. Jonadaba chu mi fing vervêk tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Aw, nang lal fapa hi eng tizia nge a ni têla i chêr telh telh chu le? Mi hrilh duh dâwn lâwm ni?” a ti a. Tin, Amnona chuan a hnênah, “Ka unaupa Absaloma farnu Tamari hi ka hmangaih miau mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jonadaba chuan a hnênah, “I khumah mu reng la, damlo der la; tin, i pain a rawn en hunah che a hnênah, ‘Khawngaih takin ka farnu Tamari chu ka hnênah lo kal sela, chhang ei tûr mi rawn pe sela; tin, ka hmuh theihah, ka mit hmuh ngeiah ei tûr mi siamsak teh se, a kuta mi ngei ka lo ei ang e,’ lo ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Amnona chu a mu a, a damlo der ta a; tin, lalin a va en chuan Amnona chuan lal hnênah, “Khawngaih takin ka farnu Tamari lo kal sela, ka mit hmuh ngeiah hian chhangpêr pahnih emaw mi siam sela, ama kuta mi ngei ka lo ei ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Tamari hnênah, “I nuṭa Amnona in lamah kal la, ei tûr va siamsak rawh khai,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Tamari chu a nuṭa Amnona in lamah chuan a kal a; tin, ani chu a lo mu reng a. Tin, chhang diak a la a, a hmet a, a mit hmuhah chhangpêr chu a siam a, a ur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a urna chu a la a, a hmaah chuan a bun a; nimahsela, a ei duh lo va. Tin, Amnona chuan, “Mi zawng zawng hian mi chhuahsan vek rawh se,” a ti a. Tichuan, an chhuahsan ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Amnona chuan Tamari hnênah, “I kuta mi ngei ka ei theih nân ei tûr chu pindanah hian han la tawh rawh le,” a ti a. Tin, Tamari chuan a chhangpêr siamte chu a la a, a nuṭa Amnona hnênah pindanah chuan a la lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eitîr tûra a kiang hnaia a va kalpui chu a lo man a, a hnênah, “Ka farnu, lo mu ve teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a. “Ni lo ve a, ka nuṭapa, mi tilui suh, Israel-te zîngah hetiang thil hi tih tûr a ni lo ve. He thil sual âtthlâk tak hi ti suh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, kei hian ka mualphona chu khawiah nge ka thangpui ang? Tin, nang pawh Israel-te zînga mi âa ngaih i lo ni mai ang asin. Chuvângin, lal be zâwk rawh khai, i mi neih chu a hnial lo vang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, a thu chu a pawm lo va, amah aiin a chak zâwk si a, a tilui a, a mutpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Amnona chuan huat namên lohvin a haw leh ta si a; a huatna chu amah a hmangaih laia a hmangaihna ai maha nasain a ni a huat ni. Tichuan, Amnona chuan a hnênah, “Tho la, kal daih mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Chuti tûr chu ni lo ve! Hetianga dik lo taka mi tihchhuah hi ka chunga i tih tâk ai mah khân a ṭha lo zâwk a ni,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a pawm duh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, a rawngbâwltu a chhiahhlawh chu a ko va, “He hmeichhia hi ka hnên ata chhuahtîr la, kawng kalh hnan tlat rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tamari chuan kawrfual ze hrang hranga zia a ha a; chutiang kawrfual chu lal nula thianghlimten an ha ṭhîn a. Chutichuan, a chhiahhlawh chuan a hruai chhuak a, kawng a kalh hnan ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Tamari chuan a luah vut a phul a, a kawrfual, ze hrang hranga zia a hâk chu a pawt thlêr a, a chhîpah a kut a dah a, ring taka ṭap chung zêlin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a nuṭa Absaloma chuan a hnênah, “I nuṭa Amnona chu i hnênah a lo lût a ni maw? Nimahsela, ngawi mai rawh, ka farnu. I nuṭa a ni alâwm, engto duh suh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Tamari chu a nuṭa Absaloma inah ngui takin a inkhung ta tlat mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lal Davidan chûng thil zawng zawng chu a han hriat chuan a thinrim ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan Amnona hnênah a chhia a ṭha, a enga mah a sawi duh lo va; Absaloma chuan a farnu Tamari a tihluih avângin Amnona chu a haw hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum hnih pumhlûm a ral hnu chuan Ephraim kianga Baal-hazor-ah Absaloman berâm hmul a mehtîr a; tin, Absaloma chuan lal fapate zawng zawng chu a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chu lal hnênah a kal a. “Ngai teh, i chhiahhlawhin berâm hmul a mehtîr a, lal leh a chhiahhlawhte chu i chhiahhlawh hnênah hian kal ve ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Absaloma hnênah, “Ni lo ve, kan tihautak lutuk dah ang che,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a sâwm lui chiam a; nimahsela, a kal duh chuang lo va, mal erawh chu a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, Absaloman, “A nih loh leh ka unaupa Amnona tal kan hnênah kal ang hmiang,” a ti a. Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Engah nge a kal bîk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Absaloma chuan Amnona leh lal fapate zawng zawng tal chu a hnêna kal ve tûrin a ngen ṭâlh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan a chhiahhlawhte chu, “Ngai teh u, Amnona uain ina a hlim laiin in hnênah, ‘Amnona chu that rawh u,’ ka tih che u chuan, that ula, hlau suh u, thu ka pe tawh che u a ni lâwm ni? Intihuai ula, intipasalṭha ang che u,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Absaloma chhiahhlawhte chuan Amnona chungah Absaloma thupêk ang chuan an ti a. Chutichuan, lal fapate zawng zawng chu an tho va, an sabengtung chungah an chuang ṭheuh va, an tlân bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kawng laka an la awm laiin, “Absaloman lal fapate zawng zawng chu a that ta vek mai a, pakhat mah a zuah lo,” tiin Davida hnênah chanchin a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu a tho va, a silhfênte a pawt thlêr a, leiah a mu ta a; tin, a chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte chu an silhfênte pawt thlêrin a kiangah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Davida unau Simea fapa Jonadaba chuan a chhâng a, “Ka pu chuan lal fapa tlangvâl zawng zawngte chu an that vek a ni tih ring suh se, Amnona chauh a ni thi ni; a farnu Tamari a tihluih achin kha Absaloma chuan hetianga tih hi a tum rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka pu lalpa chuan lal fapate zawng zawng chu an thi emaw tih ringin engto suh se, Amnona chauh a ni thi ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Absaloma erawh chu a tlân bo ta a. Tin, a râl vêngtu tlangvâl chuan a mit a lên a, a han en a; tin, ngai teh, a hnung lama tlâng panga kawngah chuan mi tam tak an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Jonadaba chuan lal hnênah, “Ngai teh, lal fapate chu an lo kal e; i chhiahhlawhin a sawi ang chiah kha a ni ngei mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a sawi zawh veleh chuan ngai teh, lal fapate chu an lo thleng a, an aw chhuah meuhvin an ṭap a; tin, lal pawh chu a chhiahhlawhte nên chuan an ṭap ta vak vak mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Absaloma erawh chu a tlân bo va, Gesur lal Amihuda fapa Talmaia hnênah a kal a. Tin, Davida chuan ni tin a fapa chu a sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, Absaloma chu a tlân bo va, Gesur ramah a kal a, chutah chuan kum thum a va awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Lal Davida chuan Absaloma hnêna kal a châk êm êm a. Amnona chungchâng thûah chuan a thlamuang ta a, ani chu a thi tawh si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Zeruii fapa Joaba chuan lal rilru chu Absaloma chungah a chêng tih a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Joaba chuan Tekoa khuaah mi a tîr a, chuta hmeichhe fing pakhat chu a va hruaitîr a, a hnênah, “Lusûn angah insiam la, lusûn puan sin la, sahriak pawh inthih lovin, hmeichhia rei tak mitthi sûn angin awm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal hnênah kal la, a hnênah hetiang hian thu va sawi ang che aw,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Joaba chuan thu a fah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Tekoa khuaa hmeichhia chuan lal hnêna thu a sawi dâwn chuan hmaia lei siin a bawkkhup a, chibai a bûk a, “Aw lalpa, min pui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Engtizia nge ni le?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Hmeithai ka ni tak tak a, ka pasal chu a thi tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, i bâwihnu hian fapa pahnih a nei a; an pahnih chuan lovah an insual a, tu mah ṭhelhtu an awm si lo va, a pakhat chuan pakhat chu a vua a, a tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, an chhûngkua zawng zawng chuan i bâwihnu hi an do rawn a, ‘A unaupa thattu chu a unaupa a thah avânga kan thah ve theih nân min pe rawh khai; tichuan, roluahtu tûr pawh kan tiboral ang,’ an ti a; chutiang chuan ka meiling la awma chu an timit ang a, ka pasal chu hming nei lo leh lei chungah thlah rêng rêng nei lovin a awm mai dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “I inah haw la, i chungchâng thûah chuan thu ka pe mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Tekoa khuaa hmeichhia chuan lal hnênah chuan, “Aw lalpa, ka pu, bawhchhiatna mawh chu ka chungah leh ka pa chhûngte chungah tla mai rawh se; tin, lal leh lalṭhutthlêng chuan mawh phur suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Tu pawh i chungah eng emaw sawi apiang chu ka hnênah rawn hruai la, an tawk leh tawh hlek lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Thisen chhuahtute chungah phuba latuten tiboral tawh lo tûrin lal chuan Lalpa i Pathian chu hre reng rawh se aw; chuti lo zawng, ka fapa hi an tiboral dah ang e,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, i fapaa sam zai khat pawh leiah hian a tla lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmeichhia chuan, “I bâwihnu hian lalpa ka pu hnênah thu kam khat chauh han sawi leh teh se aw,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Sawi ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan, “A nih leh eng vângin nge Pathian mite dodâla hetianga tih i tum? Hêng thu aṭang hian lal chu thiam loh chang angin a lang a ni, lal chuan a mi, tlân bova chu a hruai hâwn si loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan thi ngei ngei tûr a ni a; tin, tuisik leia baw hnu ruh theih tawh loh ang hi kan ni a. Pathianin nunna hi a la bo a ni lo va, tlân bova chu a laka mi hrang a nih loh nân rem a ruat a ni zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, lalpa ka pu hnêna he thu sawi tûra ka lo kal pawh hi mi ka hlauh vâng a ni a. Tin, i bâwihnu chuan, ‘Lal hnênah ka sawi phawt ang a, lal chuan a bâwihnu dîlna chu a hlawhtlintîr mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal chuan kei leh ka fapa hi Pathian roluah lo tûra tihboral tumtu laka i bâwihnu hi chhan chhuak tûrin a lo ngaihthlâksak ang chu,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, i bâwihnu tân hian lalpa ka pu thu chu thlamuanawm tak ni sela, a chhia a ṭha lo thlei tûrin lalpa ka pu chu Pathian vântirhkoh ang mai a ni si a. Tin, Lalpa Pathian chu i hnênah awm rawh se ka ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a chhâng a, hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “Ka zawh apiang che chu ka lakah eng mah zêp suh ang che aw,” a ti a. Tin, hmeichhia chuan, “Lalpa ka pu chuan sawi ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Hêng thûah rêng rêng hian Joaban telna a nei em?” a ti a. Tin, hmeichhia chuan a chhâng a, “Lalpa ka pu, i thlarau nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, lalpa ka puin a sawi tawh chu tu mahin ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw an pumpelh thei lo vang. I chhiahhlawh Joaba chuan mi tîr a, hêng thu zawng zawng hi i bâwihnu a fah vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil awm dân tidanglam tûrin hêng thil hi i chhiahhlawh Joaba chuan a tih a ni; tin, ka pu chu khawvêla thil awm zawng zawng hre theiin Pathian vântirhkoh ang maiin a fing a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Joaba hnênah, “Ngai teh, he thil hi ka remti ta e: va kal la, tlangvâl Absaloma chu va hruai leh rawh le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chu hmaia lei siin a bawkkhup a, chibai a bûk a, lal chu mal a sâwm a. Tin, Joaba chuan, “Aw lalpa ka pu, lalpa chuan a chhiahhlawh dîlna chu a hlawhtlintîr avângin, vawiinah hian i chhiahhlawh hian i mit ka tlung tih ka lo hre ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chu a tho va, Gesur-ah chuan a kal a, Absaloma chu Jerusalem-ah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Ama in lamah kal sela, ka hmêl chu rawn hmu suh se,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Absaloma chu ama in lamah chuan a kal a, lal hmêl chu a hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel zawng zawng zîngah Absaloma ang rênga hmêlṭhata fak kai tu mah an awm lo va. A ke lêr aṭangin a chhîp thlengin sawisêlna rêng rêng a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lû a meh chuan (kum vei apiangin a mêt ṭhîn a, a sam chu a rih êm ṭhin avângin a mêt ṭhîn a ni) a sam chu a bûk ṭhîn a, lal bûk dâna sekel hnih a tling ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan fapa pathum leh fanu pakhat a nei a, a fanu hming chu Tamari a ni a, hmeichhe hmêl ṭha tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Absaloma chu kum hnih pumhlûm Jerusalem-ah a awm a; nimahsela, lal hmêl rêng rêng chu a hmu lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Absaloma chuan lal hnêna tirh atân Joaba chu a chah a; nimahsela, a kal duh lo va. Tin, a chah nawn leh a, a kal duh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, a chhiahhlawhte hnênah, “I e u, Joaba lo chu ka lo kiang a ni a, barli a nei a, va hâl rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, Absaloma chhiahhlawhte chuan lo chu an va hâl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chu a tho va, Absaloma hnênah a inah a kal a, a hnênah, “Eng vângin nge i chhiahhlawhten ka lo an hâl?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan Joaba chu a chhâng a, “Ngai teh, ‘Eng atân nge Gesur aṭangin ka lo kal? Chutah chuan awm reng ila ka tân a ṭha zâwk tûr,’ tia lal hnêna tirh atân ka chah chia. Chuvângin, lal hmêl chu mi hmuhtîr rawh khai; tin, bawhchhiatna nei ka lo nih chuan mi tihlum mai ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chu lal hnênah chuan a kal a, a hrilh a. Tin, Absaloma chu a ko va, lal hnênah a kal a, lal hmaah chuan hmaia lei siin a bawkkhup a. Tin, lal chuan Absaloma chu a fâwp a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng thil hnuah chuan Absaloma chuan tawlailîr leh sakawrte leh mi sawmnga a hmaa tlân tûrin a buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chu zînga takah a tho va, kulh kawngkhâr kawngah chuan a lo ding ṭhîn a; tin, lal hnêna thupawi rawn sawi tûr apiangte chu Absaloma chuan a lo ko va, “Khawii khua nge i nih?” a lo ti zêl ṭhîn a. Tin, “I chhiahhlawh hi Israel hnamte zînga hnam pakhat ka ni,” an ti zêl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan, “I e, i thu chu a ṭhain a dik a; nimahsela, ngaihtuahtu tûr lalin tu mah a ruat lo,” a lo ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma vêk chuan, “Mi tin, thupawi sawi tûr nei emaw, dîl tûr nei emaw apiang chu ka hnênah an lo kalna tûrin, kei hi hemi ram rorêltuah mi siam sela ka va ti êm ve aw! Chutichuan, fel takin ka rêlsak ṭhîn tûr,” te a lo ti bawk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hetiang pawh hian a ti a, tu pawh amah chibai bûk tûra han hnaih apiangte chu a lo ban a, a chelh a, a lo fâwp ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mi, lal hnêna thusawi tûra lo kal apiangte chu Absaloma chuan chutiang chuan a lo ti zêl ṭhîn a. Chutichuan, Absaloma chuan Israel mite thinlung chu a hîpsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum li a lo vei chuan Absaloma chuan lal hnênah, “Hebron khuaa Lalpa hnêna ka thutiam hlen tûrin mi kaltîr rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hian Suria rama Gesur-a ka awm lai khân, ‘ Lalpan Jerusalem-a mi hruai leh phawt chuan Lalpa rawng ka bâwl ang,’ tiin thu ka lo tiam tawh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Thlamuang takin kal rawh khai,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a tho va, Hebron-ah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, Absaloma chuan, “Tawtawrâwt ri in hriat veleh, ‘Absaloma chu Hebron-ah lal a ni,’ ti ang che u,” tiin Israel hnam zawng zawngte hnênah mi a tîr ru ta hlauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma hnênah chuan a mi sâwm, mi zahnih Jerusalem aṭangin an kal ve a, rilru ṭha tak puin an kal a, eng mah an hre ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan inthawinate chu a hlan laiin, Gilon mi Ahithophela, Davida rorêlpui chu, a khua Gilo ata a chah a. An thu phiar chu a nasa hle mai a; Absaloma lamah chuan mipuite chu an pung tulh tulh mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida hnênah chuan, “Israel mite rilru chu Absaloma lamah a thle hle mai,” tiin mi a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Jerusalem-a a ṭhuihruai zawng zawngte hnênah chuan, “Tho ula, i tlân chhuak ang u, tu mah Absaloma lakah hian kan chhuak thei âwm si lo va. Chhuak thuai rawh u khai; chuti lo zawng, min rawn ûmphâk thuai mai ang a, kan chungah hian thil ṭha lo tak a rawn thlen ang a, khandaihin khua hi a rawn bei dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, lal mite chuan lal hnênah, “Ngai teh, i chhiahhlawhte hi kan pu, kan lalin a ruat apiang ti tûrin kan inpeih reng e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a chhuak a, a chhûngte zawng zawngin an zui a. Tin, lal chuan in nghâk tûrin hmeichhe sâwm, hmeihote chu a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a chhuak a, mipui zawng zawngte chuan an zui a; tin, Beth-merhak-ah an châwl rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a mi zawng zawngte chuan an kal pêl a; tin, Kerith mi zawng zawng te, Peleth mi zawng zawng te, Git mi zawng zawng te, mi zaruk Gath aṭanga amah rawn zuitute chuan lal chu an bêl zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan Git mi Itaia hnênah chuan, “Engtizia nge nang hi i lo kal ve? Kîr leh la, lal hnênah awm rawh. Nang chu mikhual, ram danga mi i ni bawk si a, nangma hmun lamah kîr leh rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimin lawka lo kal i ni, vawiinah hian kan hnêna a chhuk a chhova min zui tûrin ka tih ve tûr che i ni em ni? Ka kal theih theihnaah ka kal dâwn a ni a; nang chu kîr leh la, i unaute zawng zawng hi hruai kîr rawh. Khawngaihna leh thutak i hnênah awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Itaia chuan lal chu a chhâng a, “ Lalpa nunna leh lal, ka pu nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, lal, ka pu hi i awmna tawh phawtah chuan, thih leh thih a ni ang a, dam leh dam a ni ang a, i chhiahhlawh hi a awm ve zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Itaia hnênah chuan, “Kal ula, kal zêl rawh u le,” a ti a. Tichuan, Git mi Itaia chu a mite zawng zawng leh an fanau zawng zawngte nên chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ring takin a ram ṭahin an ṭap a, mipuite chu an kal vek a; thlalêr kawng lam panin lal pawh chuan Kidron lui chu a kân a; tin, mipui zawng zawngte chuan an kân bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Zadoka te chu Pathian thuthlung bâwm zâwnin Levi-ho zawngte nên a hnênah an kal ve a; Pathian bâwm chu an nghat a, mipuiin khua chu an chhuahsan kim vek thlengin Abiathara chu a han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Zadoka hnênah, “Pathian bâwm chu khawpui chhûngah zâwn haw leh rawh u. Lalpa mit tlunga ka awm chuan mi hruai haw leh ang a, Pathian bâwm leh a awmna chu mi hmuhtîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ‘Nangmahah lâwmna rêng ka nei lo,’ a tih chuan ngai teh, heti mai hi ka ni a, ṭha a tih ang angin ka chungah hian ti mai rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal chuan puithiam Zadoka hnênah chuan, “Hmutheitu i ni lâwm ni? I fapate pahnih, i fapa Ahimaaza leh Abiathara fapa Jonathana nên thlamuang takin khawpuiah haw leh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngai teh, kei chu chanchin mi rawn hriattîr hma loh chu thlalêra lui kaiahte hian ka lo awm ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Zadoka leh Abiathara chuan Pathian bâwm chu Jerusalem-ah an kalpui leh a; tin, chutah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu Olive tlâng chhohnaah chuan a lâwn chho va, chhoh pah chuan a ṭap zêl a; a lû a khum a, ke lâwngin a kal a. Tin, a hnêna mi awm zawng zawngte chuan lû an khum ṭheuh va, ṭap chung zêlin an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, tuin emaw Davida chu, “Ahithophela chu Absaloma lamah ṭangin phiartute zîngah a tel ve,” tiin a hrilh a. Tin, Davida chuan, “Aw Lalpa , Ahithophela remruat chu âtnaah chantîr tûrin ka ngên a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Davida chu Pathian biakna tlâng chhîp a han lâwn chhuah chuan, ngai teh, Ark mi Husaia chu a kawr pawh thlêr haa, a lua lei kai luamin amah hmuak tûrin a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnênah, “Ka hnêna i kal ve chuan ka tân phurrit i ni mai ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, khawpui lamah chuan i kîra, Absaloma hnêna, ‘Aw lalpa, i chhiahhlawhah ka awm ang e, tûn hma lama i pa chhiahhlawha ka awm ang khân tûnah hian i chhiahhlawhah ka awm tawh thung ang e,’ i va tih erawh chuan Ahithophela remruat mi dâlsaktu i ni zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutah chuan i hnênah puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara pawh an awm ve a ni lâwm ni? Chutichuan, heti hi a ni ang a, lal ina thuchhuak i hriat apiang chu puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara i hrilh ṭhîn ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ngai teh, an fapate pahnih, Zadoka fapa Ahimaaza leh Abiathara fapa Jonathana pawh an hnênah an awm kha; tin, i thil hriat apiangte chu mi hriattîr tûrin anmahni chu i rawn tîr ṭhîn dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida ṭhian Husaia chu khawpuiah chuan a lût a; tin, Absaloma chu Jerusalem-ah a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan tlâng chhîp lâwn chhuahna a pelh hlek hnu chuan, ngai teh, Mephibosetha chhiahhlawh Ziba chuan a lo hmuak a, sabengtung pahnih a thuam a, chhang tlang zahnih leh grêp pho ro bâwr za leh nipui thei za leh uain peng khat a phurhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Ziba hnênah chuan, “Hêng hi eng tizia nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, Ziba chuan, “Sabengtungte hi lal chhûngte chuan nân a ni ang a, chhang leh nipui theite hi tlangvâlte ei atân a ni ang a, uain hi chu thlalêra chau apiangte in atân a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “A nih leh khawiah nge i pu fapa chu?” a ti a. Tin, Ziba chuan lal hnênah, “Ngai teh, Jerusalem-ah a awm; ‘Vawiinah hian Israel-hote chuan ka pa ram mi pe leh dâwn,’ a ti nghe nghe asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Ziba hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, Mephibosetha thil neih zawng zawng chu i ta vek a ni ta,” a ti a. Tin, Ziba chuan, “Chibai ka bûk tak zet che a ni; aw lalpa ka pu, i mit tlun zêl ka tum ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lal Davidan Bahurim a thlen chuan ngai teh, Saula chhûngte zînga mi Gera fapa a hming Simeia a lo chhuak a; ânchhe lawh chung zêlin a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida chu lungin a dêng a, Lal Davida chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte pawh. Tin, mipui zawng zawng leh sipai huaisen zawng zawngte chu a ding lamah leh a vei lamah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Simeia chuan ânchhe lawh chungin heti hian a ti a, “Kal bo daih rawh! Kal bo daih rawh! Nang thisen chhuah hmang leh Beliala mihringpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A rorêl ai i rêl tâk Saula chhûngte thisen chu Lalpan i chungah a rawn lêttîr ta a; tin, Lalpa chuan ram chu i fapa Absaloma a pe ta. Tin, ngai teh, thisen chhuah hmang mi i nih avângin nangmaha pawi i inkhawih chawp a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Zeruii fapa Abisaia chuan lal hnênah, “Engati nge he ui thisâwn hian lalpa ka pu chu ânchhia a lawh mai mai? A lu ka va tan teh mai ang aw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Nangni Zeruii fapate u, nangni hian mi lo hriatsak tûr eng nge awm? Lalpan a hnêna, ‘Davida ânchhia lawh rawh,’ a tih si chuan lawh mai ang hmiang. ‘Engati nge hetianga i tih?’ tuin nge ti tehlul ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Abisaia leh a chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh u, ka fapa, ka rîla rah ngei chuan mi thah a tum a ni a; he Benjamin mi hian a va tum nasa lehzual dâwn êm! Eng mah tih suh ula, ânchhia chu lawh mai rawh se; Lalpa tihtîr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hrehawmzia hi a rawn hmu ang, Lalpa chuan vawiina ânchhe mi lawh hi a ṭha lamin mi rûl leh mai pawh a ni thei e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh a mite chu kawngah chuan an kal zêl a; tin, Simeia chu an râl tlâng pangah chuan a kal zêl a, a kal pah chuan ânchhia a lawh zêl a, lungtein a dêng a, vaivuttein a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, lal leh a hnêna mi awm zawng zawngte chuan chau takin Aiphim an thleng a; tichuan, chutah chuan an châwl hahdam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma leh mipui zawng zawng, Israel mite chu Jerusalem-ah an kal a; tin, a hnênah Ahithophela pawh a tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Ark mi Husaia, Davida ṭhian chuan Absaloma hnên a thlenin Absaloma hnênah, “Pathianin lalber humhim rawh se! Pathianin lalber humhim rawh se!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan Husaia hnênah, “Hetiang hi a ni maw i ṭhian i khawngaih dân chu? Engati nge i ṭhian hnêna i kal loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Husaia chuan Absaloma hnênah, “Ka kal lo vang; Lalpa leh hêng mipuite leh Israel mi zawng zawngin an thlana thû thûin ka awm ang a, a hnênah ka awm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, tu rawng nge ka bâwl ang? A fapa hmaah rawng ka bâwl tûr a ni lâwm ni? I pa hmaa rawng ka bâwl ang khân i hmaah ka bâwl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Absaloma chuan Ahithophela hnênah, “Engtin nge kan tih ang, i ngaih dân sawi teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Ahithophela chuan Absaloma hnênah, “I pa hmei, in nghâka a dahte hnênah va lût rawh; tin, Israel mi zawng zawngin i pain a lungten che tih an lo hria ang a; tichuan, i lama ṭangte zawng zawng kut chu a chak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, in chungah Absaloma tân puan in an zâr a; tichuan, Israel mite zawng zawng mit hmuhah a pa hmeite hnênah chuan a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng laia rem a ruat, Ahithophela remruatte chu Pathian thu anga ngaih a ni ṭhîn a. Chutiang bawk chuan Ahithophelan Davida leh Absaloma rem a ruatpui zawng zawngte chu ngaih a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng lo pawh chu Absaloma hnênah Ahithophela chuan, “Mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih ka thlang chhuak ang a; tin, zâninah hian Davida ûmin ka thawk ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chauh lai leh a chak loh lai tak ka va nangchîng ang a, ka va tihlau vang e. Tichuan, a hnêna mi awm zawng zawng chu an tlân bo vang a; tichuan, lal chauh chu ka va that mai ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu i hnênah ka rawn hruai kîr vek ang. I mi zawna tih loh mi zawng zawng an lo kîr chuan mi zawng zawng inremin an awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi thu chuan Absaloma leh Israel upaho zawng zawngte chu a tilâwm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Absaloma chuan, “Ark mi Husaia chu ko ve phawt ula, a sawi ve dân i lo ngaithla teh ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Husaian Absaloma hnên a lo thlen chuan Absaloma chuan, “Ahithophela chuan hetiang hian a sawi a, a sawi ang hian kan ti dâwn em ni ang? Ti dâwn lo ila, nangin han sawi ve teh khai,” tiin a lo bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Husaia chuan Absaloma hnênah, “Tûn ṭuma Ahithophela remruat hi a ṭha lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Husaia chuan, “I pa leh a mite chu i hria a, sipai huai tak, mi kawlhsen tak, phûla savawm, a no lâksak ang mai an ni a; tin, i pa chu indo mi a ni a, mipui zîngah a riak kher lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, tûnah pawh khawii lai khuarkhurumah emaw, khawii hmunah emaw a biru reng ang. Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, an inbeih tirhah mi ṭhenkhat an tlûk nual chuan a hria apiangin, ‘Absaloma zuitute chu an that chiam mai,’ an ti mai ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, mi huaisen tak, sakeibaknei rilru ang pu mi meuh pawh a lo zâm hle mai ang a; Israel mi zawng zawng lah chuan i pa chu sipai huai tak a nih leh a hnêna mi awmte chu mi huaisen tak tak an nih an hre vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keia remruat ve dân chu, Israel mite zawng zawng chu Dan aṭangin Beer-seba thleng rawkin tuifinriata ṭiau zât zetin i hnênah ko khâwm vek ila; tin, indonaah chuan nangmah meuh kal ve la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, khawii hmunah pawh kan tawn fuhna apiangah leia dai tla ang maiin kan bawh ang a; tin, amah leh a hnêna mi awm zawng zawngte chu pakhat mah kan zuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Chu lovah pawh, khuaah a luh chuan Israel mi zawng zawng, hruizên kengin chumi khuaah chuan kan va kal ang a, lung tê tak tê pawh awm hauh lo khawpin luiah kan hnûk thla vek ang,” a ti leh nghâl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Absaloma leh Israel mi zawng zawngte chuan, “Ark mi Husaia remruat chu Ahithophela remruat ai chuan a ṭha zâwk,” an ti ta a. Lalpa chuan Ahithophela remruat ṭha tak chu letthla tûrin a lo ruat tawh rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Husaia chuan puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara hnênah, “Chutiang khatiang chuan Ahithophela chuan Absaloma leh Israel upate rem a ruatsak a; tin, keiin chutiang khatiang chuan rem ka ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, ‘Zanin chu thlalêra lui kaiahte riak tawh lovin kân ngei ngei rawh; chuti lo chuan, lal leh a hnêna awm zawng zawngte chu an tiboral vek dah ang e,’ tiin Davida hrilhtîr thuai rawh u khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonathana leh Ahimaaza chu En-rogel-ah an awm a, bâwihnu pakhat hian anni chu a va hrilh ṭhîn a; tin, anni chuan Lal Davida chu an va hrilh lehchhâwng ṭhîn a. Khawpuia an lût chu tu ma hmuh loh tûr a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, naupangin a lo hmu a, Absaloma a hrilh a; tichuan, an pahnihin an tlân bo ta thuai a, Bahurim-a mi pakhat, a tuala tuichhunchhuah nei inah an va kal a, tuichhunchhuahah chuan an lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhiain tuichhunchhuah chhinnain a chhîn a, a chungah chuan buh a pho va, tu ma hriat theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chhiahhlawhte chu ina hmeichhe hnênah chuan an va kal a; “Ahimaaza leh Jonathana-te kha khawiah nge?” an ti a. Tin, hmeichhia chuan an hnênah, “Lui an kân tawh ang,” a lo ti a. Tin, an va zawng a, an hmu lo va, Jerusalem-ah an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, an kal liam hnu chuan tuichhunchhuah ata chu an lo chhuak a, Lal Davida chu an va hrilh a; Davida hnênah chuan, “Chhuak ula, lui chu kân thuai rawh u; hetiang hian Ahithophela chuan a phiar che u a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh a hnêna mi awm zawng zawng chu an chhuak a, Jordan lui an kân a; khua a lo var chuan pakhat mah Jordan lui kân lo an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Ahithophelan a remruat ang chu an zâwm lo tih a hriatin a sabengtung chu a thuam a, a chhuak a, a khaw lamah a haw a, a chhûngte khawsak dân tûr a ruatsak diam a, a inâwk hlum ta a; tichuan, a thi a, a pa thlânah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Mahanaim a va thleng a. Tin, Absaloma chuan a hnêna Israel mi zawng zawngte nên Jordan lui an kân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan Joaba aiah Amasa chu sipaite hotuah a dah a. Amasa chu, mi pakhat a hming Ithra, Israel mi Joaba nu Zeruii laizâwn Nahasi fanu Abigaili pâwltu fapa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite leh Absaloma chuan Gilead ramah ṭanhmun an va khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Davidan Mahanaim a thlen chuan Amona thlah Raba khuaa mi Nahasa fapa Sobia te, Lo-debar khuaa mi Amiela fapa Makira te, Rogelim khuaa Gilead mi Barzilaia te chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Mipuite chu thlalêrah chuan an rilṭâmin an chauvin, an tuihâl tawh êm êm a ni,” an tih avânga khum te, maihûn te, hlum bêl te, buh te, barli te, chhangphut te, vai te, be te, dailuah te, be kan ro te, khawizû te, bâwnghnute khal te, berâm leh bâwnghnute khal uih te, Davida leh a hnêna mi awmte ei tûrin an rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnêna mi awmte chu a chhiar a, sipai sâng chunga hotute, za chunga hotute a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan mite chu a tîr chhuak a, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu Joaban a ho va; tin, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu Joaba unaupa, Zeruii fapa Abisaian a ho va; tin, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu Git mi Itaian a ho va. Tin, lal chuan mipui hnênah, “Keimah ngei pawh in hnênah ka kal ve ngei ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, mipuite chuan, “Kal ve lo ve! Keiniho hi chu tlân bo ta pawh ni ila, pawi an ti lo vang a; tin, a chanve lai pawh hi va thi mah ila, pawi an ti hek lo vang. Nang chu keiniho sîng tlukin i hlu si a; chuvângin, khawpui aṭanga min ṭanpui tûra inpeih renga i lo awm chu a ṭha zâwk a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan an hnênah, “Ṭha in tih ang apiang chuan ka ti ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, lal chu kulh kawngka bulah chuan a ding a; tin, mipui zawng zawng chu za têl têl leh sâng têl têlin an chhuak ta zut zut mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Joaba leh Abisaia leh Itaia chu, “Keimah vângin, tlangvâl Absaloma chu dîm takin va ti ang che u,” tiin thu a pe a. Mipui zawng zawngin Absaloma chungchâng thûa lalin sipai hotute zawng zawng thu a pêk lai chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite chu Israel mite do tûrin indona hmun lamah chuan an kal ta a. Tin, an indona chu Ephraim ram ngaw a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan Davida mite hmaah chuan Israel mite chu an tlâwm ta a; tin, chutah chuan chumi ni chuan mi sînghnih zet an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An indona chuan chumi lai ram zawng zawng chu a huam vek mai si a; chumi ni chuan khandaih ai mahin ram ngawin a lem hnem zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma chuan Davida mite chu a va tâwk ta thut a. Absaloma chu a sabengtung chungah a chuang a. Sabengtung chu sasaw thing zâr buk tak hnuaiah a lût a, Absaloma lû chu sasaw thingah chuan a tâng ta a, lei si lo, vân si lovin a uai ta reng mai a. Tin, sabengtung chu a tlân ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, tu emaw hian a hmu a, Joaba a hrilh a, “Ngai teh, sasaw thinga Absaloma inkhai reng ka hmu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan a hrilhtu hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, chu chu i hmu si a, engati nge i tihhluma, leiah i tihthlâk nghâl loh? Chutiang chuan ti la chu tangkaraw sâwm leh kâwnghrên ka pe tûr che a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mi chuan Joaba hnênah, “Tangkaraw sâng pawh hmu dâwn mah ila, lal fapa chungah ka kut ka thlâk lo rêng rêng ang; kan beng hriat ngeiah lalin nang leh Abisaia leh Itaia hnênah, ‘Tlangvâl Absaloma chu tu mahin khawih hlek suh se,’ tiin thu a pe si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rinawm lo takin lo that ta ringawt mai ila (lal lakah chuan eng mah thup theih a ni âwm si lo va), nang chu i inthiarfihlîm leh mai âwm si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chuan, “Hetiang chuan i kiangah ka awm reng thei tawp lo mai,” a ti a, fei pathum a keng a, sasaw thing zînga dama lo la awm Absaloma thinhnûn takah chuan a chhun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Joaba râlthuam kengtu tlangvâl sâwm chuan an rawn hual a, Absaloma chu an chhun a, an that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm a, Israel-ho ûmtu mipuite chu an lo kîr ta a. Joaba chuan mipuite chu a dang ta tlat mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma ruang chu an la a, ngawah khuarkhurum thûk takah chuan an paih a, a chungah chuan lung an tiang khâwm thûr a; tin, Israel mi zawng zawngte chu mahni puan in ṭheuhvah an tlân haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Absaloma chuan a dam laiin lal ruamah lung tian a lo tiang tawh diam a; “Ka hming daih lohna tûrin fapa pawh ka nei si lo va,” a ti a. Chumi lung tian hmingah chuan ama hming a puttîr a; tûn thlengin Absaloma hriat rengna tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Zadoka fapa Ahimaaza chuan, “Ka va tlân ang a, Lalpan a hmêlma phuba a lâksak dân chanchin hi lal chu ka va hrilh ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan a hnênah, “Vawiinah zawng chanchin chu va la hrilh suh, ni dangah la hrilh zâwk ang che. Lal fapa chu a thih tâk avângin, vawiinah zawng chanchin eng mah va hrilh suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Joaba chuan Kus mi hnênah chuan, “Kal la, i thil hmuh va hrilh rawh le,” a ti a. Tin, Kus mi chuan Joaba chu kûnin chibai a bûk a, a tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Zadoka fapa Ahimaaza chuan Joaba hnênah, “Eng pawh ni sela, Kus mi kha ka va ûm tâng e,” a ti leh a. Tin, Joaba chuan, “Ka fapa, chanchin hrilh man i hmu dâwn si lo va, engah nge i tlân ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan, “Eng pawh ni sela, ka tlân ang e,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Tlân mai rawh le,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Ahimaaza chu phaizâwl lam kawngah a tlân a, Kus mi chu a lehpêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu kulh kawngka chhâwng inkârah chuan a lo ṭhu a. Tin, râlvêngtu chu kulh kawngka pâwnta zâwk chung lamah chuan a chho va, a han hawi vêl ruai ruai a; tin, ngai teh, mi pakhat amah chauhvin a lo tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, râlvêngtu chu a au va, lal chu a hrilh a. Tin, râlvêngtu chuan, “Mi pakhat mai a nih chuan chanchin rawn sawi tûr a nei a ni ang,” a ti a. Tin, a lo kal thuai thuai a, a lo hnai ta telh telh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, râlvêngtu chuan mi dang lo tlân a hmu leh a; tin, râlvêngtu chuan kawngkhâr vêngtu a au va. “Ngai teh, mi dang amah chauhvin a lo tlân leh e,” a ti a. Tin, lal chuan, “Ani pawh chuan chanchin a rawn thlen ve dâwn a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, râlvêngtu chuan, “A hmasa zâwka tlân dân chu Zadoka fapa Ahimaaza tlân dân ang hlein ka hria,” a ti a. Tin, lal chuan, “Ani chu mi ṭha tak a ni a, Chanchin Ṭha a rawn thlen dâwn a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Ahimaaza chuan a au va, lal hnênah, “A fel vek e,” a ti a. Tin, a hmaia lei siin lal hmaah chuan chibai bûkin a kûn a, “Lalpa ka pu beih tuma kut thlâk tumtute dangchattu Lalpa i Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Tlangvâl Absaloma chu a dam alâwm maw?” a ti a. Tin, Ahimaaza chuan a chhâng a, “Joaban lal chhiahhlawh, kei i chhiahhlawh ngei hi mi tirh chhuah laiin an buai mur mur ka hmu a; nimahsela, eng nge ni tih erawh chu ka hre lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Ka sîrah hian lo ding rih rawh,” a ti a. Tin, a sîrah a lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Kus mi chu a lo thleng a; tin, Kus mi chuan, “Lalpa ka pu tân chanchin ka rawn thlen e; i chunga helho zawng zawng phuba chu vawiinah hian Lalpan a lâksâk ta che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Kus mi hnênah chuan, “Tlangvâl Absaloma chu a dam alâwm maw?” a ti a. Tin, Kus mi chuan a chhâng a, “Lalpa ka pu hmêlmate leh i chhiatna zawngtute zawng zawng chu chu tlangvâl ang chuan awm vek rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu a mangang ta hle mai a, kulh kawngka chunga pindanah chuan a chho va, a ṭap a. Tin, a chhoh pah chuan, “Aw ka fapa Absalom, ka fapa, ka fapa Absalom, i aiah han thi teh zâwk ila aw! Aw Absalom ka fapa, ka fapa!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba chu an hrilh a, “Ngai teh, lal chuan Absaloma chu a ṭah a, a sûn e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi nia an hnehna chu mi zawng zawng tân sûnna a lo ni ta zâwk a. “Lal chu a fapa avâng chuan a lungngai êm êm mai,” an tih chu chumi ni chuan mipuite chuan an lo hre ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu indonaa mi an tlân bo, an zah avânga a rûka an kal bo angin chumi ni chuan a rûkin khawpuiah an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hmai a hup a, “Aw ka fapa Absalom! Aw Absalom, ka fapa, ka fapa!” tiin lal chu a ṭap hawm hawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chu inah lal hnênah chuan a lût a, “I nunna te, i fapate leh i fanute nunna leh i nupuite leh i hmeite nunna chhanhimtute chu vawiinah hian zak takin i siam tâk hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nangmah hawtute chu i hmangaiha, nangmah hmangaihtute i huat tlat maiah hian. Hotute leh sipaite chu i tân eng mah ni lo angin vawiinah hian i tilang ta a; Absaloma chu dam sela, keini zawng zawng hi vawiinah hian thi ta vek zâwk ni ila, chu chu i lâwm zâwng tak ni âwmin vawiinah hian ka hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvangin, tho la, chhuak la, i mite tilungawi zâwng takin thu sawi rawh. I chhuah loh chuan Lalpa chhâlin chhia ka chham a ni, mi pakhat mah zâninah hian i hnêna awm an awm lo vang. Tin, chu chu i tân, i tleirâwl ata tûn thlenga i chunga thil ṭha lo lo thleng zawng ai mahin a ṭha lo zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu a tho va, kulh kawngkaah chuan a ṭhu a. “Ngai teh u, lal chu kulh kawngkaah chuan a ṭhu e,” tiin mipui zawng zawng chu an hrilh a. Tin, mipui zawng zawng chu lal hmaah chuan an va kal ta a. Israel-ho erawh chu mahni puan in ṭheuhvah an tlân haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Lal chuan kan hmêlmate kut ata min chhan chhuak a, Philistia mite kut ata min chhandam ta a; tin, tûnah hian he ram aṭang hian Absaloma chu a tlân chhuahsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Absaloma, kan lal atâna hriak kan thiha chu indonaah a thi ta si a. Engati nge lal chu kam khat maha koh kîr zai in rêl loh?” tiin Israel mite zawng zawng chu an inhnial ta mur mur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Davida chuan puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara hnênah chuan, “Juda upate hnênah chuan, ‘Engati nge lal chu a in lama hruai kîr thûah a zawiawi berah in ṭan? Israel miten lal hruai kîr thu an sawi chu lal hnên a thleng tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute in ni a, ka thisen zawmpui in ni si a, engati nge ni a zawiawi bera in ṭan chu ni ngai le?’ tiin sawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Amasa hnênah, ‘Ka thisen zawmpui i ni lâwm ni? Joaba aiah ka hmaa sipaite hotua ka siam loh va ka siam loh che chuan, Pathianin a tih tihin min ti mai sela, chu aia nasa pawhin,’ a ti e, va ti rawh u,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda mite zawng zawng rilru chu mi pakhat rilru ang maiin a tithle ta dual a; tichuan, lal hnênah, “I mite zawng zawng nên khân lo haw leh rawh u,” ti tûrin mi an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu a haw leh a, Jordan a va thleng a. Tin, Juda-te chu lal lo hmuaka, lal chu Jordan-a lo hruai kai tûrin Gilgal-ah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Bahurim khuaa mi Benjamin mi Gera fapa Simeia chu hmanhmawh takin Lal Davida hmuak tûrin Juda-hote rualin a chhuk ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah Benjamin mi sâng nên, Saula chhûngte chhiahhlawh Ziba, a fapa sâwm leh panga leh a chhiahhlawh sawmhnih nên an tel ve a; tin, lal mit hmuhah chuan Jordan an kân hmawk hmawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lal chhûngte hruai kai nân leh ṭha a tih ang apianga a tih atân lawng an kal kaipui a. Tin, Jordan lui a han kai chuan Gera fapa Simeia chu lal hmaah chuan a bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, lal hnênah chuan, “Ka pu chuan khawlohna neiah mi ruat lo hrâm sela, lalpa ka puin Jerusalem a chhuahsan nia i chhiahhlawhin dik lo taka a lo tih tâkte chu hre reng hek suh sela, lal chuan rilruah pai suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hian thil ka tisual tih ka inhria a; chuvângin, ngai teh, Josefa chhûng zawng zawngte zînga ka pu lalpa chu hmuak tûra vawiinah hian a lo chhuk hmasa bera ka ni nghe nghe asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, Zeruii fapa Abisaia chuan a chhâng a, “ Lalpa hriak thiha chu ânchhia a lawh avângin Simeia hi tihhlum tûr a ni dâwn lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Nangni Zeruii fapate u, nangni hian mi lo hriatsak tûr eng nge awm? Vawiinah hian mi dotute in ni lâwm ni? Vawiinah hian Israel zinga mi rêng rêng tihhlum tûr em ni? Vawiinah hian Israel mite chungah lal ka nih hi ka hre lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Simeia hnênah chuan, “I thi tawp lo vang,” a ti a. Lal chuan a hnênah chhia a chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Saula fapa Mephibosetha chu lal hmuak tûrin a lo chhuk a; lal a kal chhuah ni aṭanga râlmuanga a lo haw leh ni thleng chuan a kete chu a chei lo va, a khabe hmul a chep rual lo va, a puante pawh a su hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, lal hmuak tûra Jerusalem-a a kal chu lalin a hnênah, “Mephiboseth, engati nge ka hnênah i kal ve loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Aw lalpa, ka pu, ka chhiahhlawhin mi bum a ni. I chhiahhlawh chuan, ‘Lal hnêna kal tûra ka chuan nân sabengtung ka thuam ang e,’ ka ti a; i chhiahhlawh hi a ke a bai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, lalpa ka pu hnênah chuan i chhiahhlawh hi a hêk a; nimahsela, lalpa ka pu chu Pathian vântirhkoh ang a ni a. Chuvângin, ṭha i tih ang angin ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka pa chhûngte zawng zawng chu lalpa ka pu hmaah chuan tihhlum vek âwm an ni ngei a; mahse, i chhiahhlawh hi i chaw kîlpuite zîngah i teltîr a. Chuvângin, lal hnênah hian thil dang phût ngam âwm ka la ni cheu vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “I chungchâng thu hi engah nge i sawi leh ṭhin? ‘Nang leh Ziba chuan ram chu insem rawh u,’ ka ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Mephibosetha chuan lal hnênah, “E, amahin nei vek rawh se, lalpa ka pu chu ama inah râlmuangin a lo thleng ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Gilead mi Barzilaia chu Rogelim aṭangin a lo chhuk a; lal chu Jordan-a hruai kai tûrin a hnênah Jordan a kai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Barzilaia chu upa tak a ni a, kum sawmriat mi zet a ni a; Mahanaim-a lal awm chhûng khân ei tûrte a lo tum a, mi neinung tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Barzilaia hnênah chuan, “Ka hnênah kai ve la, ka hnênah Jerusalem-ah ka châwm ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Barzilaia chuan lal hnênah, “Eng chen la dam tûr nge ka niha, Jerusalem-a lal hnêna ka han chhoh vena tûr chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tûnah hian kum sawmriat ka ni a; a chhia leh a ṭha pawh thlei thei em ka nih? I chhiahhlawh hian ka thil ei leh inte hi a tui leh tui loh pawh ka hre thei tawh em ni? Mipa leh hmeichheho hla sak ri pawh ka hre thei tawh em ni? Chuvângin, i chhiahhlawh hi eng atân nge lalpa ka pu tân phurrit ka nih mai ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hian lal hnênah Jordan râl kai ve chauh ka tum a ni. Engah nge lal chuan chutianga ṭhat man mi rulh ve thung kher ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khawngaih takin, i chhiahhlawh hi mi hawtîr leh mai la, ka nu leh ka pa thlân awmna keimahni khua ngeiah ka thi ang e. Amaherawhchu, en teh, i chhiahhlawh Chimhama hi; lalpa ka pu hnênah kai sela, a chungah ṭha i tih ang apiangin ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a chhâng a, “Chimhama chu ka hnênah a kal ve ang a, ṭha i tih ang zêlin a chungah ka ti ang; tin, thil eng pawh mi dil apiang chu ka tihsak zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawngte chu Jordan râl an kai a; tin, lal chuan Barzilaia chu a fâwp a, mal a sâwm a; tin, ama hmun lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu Gilgal-ah a kai a, Chimhama chu a hnênah chuan a kai ve a. Tin, Juda mi zawng zawng chuan lal chu an hruai kai a, Israel mi pawh a chanve an tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Israel mi zawng zawng chu lal hnênah an lo kal a, lal hnênah chuan, “Engati nge kan unau Juda mite hian an chan bîk chia, lal leh a chhûngte leh Davida mi zawng zawngte pawh Jordan râla an hruai tel vek mai?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Juda mi zawng zawngte chuan Israel mite chu an chhâng a, “Lal chu kan lamhnai a nih avâng a ni. Engati nge hemi thûah hian in thinrim mai? Lal neih ringa awm em kan nih tehlul? Thil pêk eng emaw te pawh min nei em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan Juda mite chu an chhâng a, “Lalah hian chan sâwm kan nei a; chuvângin, Davida-ah hian nangni aiin chanvo kan ngah zâwk asin. Engati nge min ngaihnêp mai? Lal hruai kîr thu hi rawt hmasatu kan ni lâwm ni kha?” an ti a. Chutichuan, Juda mite thu chu Israel mite thu ai chuan a rum ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan Benjamin mi, Bikria fapa a hming Seba, Beliala mi pakhat a lo awm kher a. Tawtawrâwt a hâm a, “Davida-ah hian chanvo kan nei lo va, Jesaia fapaah hian roluah tûr kan nei hek lo; aw Israel mite u, in puan in lam ṭheuhvah haw rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mi zawng zawngin Davida an zui chu an lêtsan a, Bikria fapa Seba chu an zui ta a. Juda mite erawh chuan Jordan aṭangin Jerusalem thlengin an lal chu an vuan ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Jerusalem-a a in chu a thleng a; tin, lal chuan hmeichhe sâwm, a hmeite, in nghâk atâna a dahte chu a hruai a, a khung a, an ei tûr a tum a; nimahsela, an hnênah a lût lo va. Tichuan, an thih ni thlenga khunga awmin hmeithaiin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan Amasa hnênah, “Ni thum chhûngin Juda mite mi koh khâwmsak la; tin, nang pawh lo awm ve ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Amasa chu Juda mite ko khâwm tûrin a kal ta a; amaherawhchu, a hun ruatsak aiin a va thang rei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Davidan Abisaia hnênah chuan, “Bikria fapa Seba hian Absaloma ai mahin kan pawi a khawih dâwn alâwm le. I pu mite hruai la, ûm rawh u khai; chuti lo chuan, khaw kulh neiahte a lût hman ang a, kan hmuh phâk lohvah kan chhuah mai dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Joaba hote, Kereth mite, Peleth mite leh an mi chak zawng zawngte chuan amah an zui chhuak ta a. Jerusalem aṭang chuan Bikria fapa Seba ûm tûr chuan an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeon-a lungpui awmna an va thlen chuan Amasa chuan anmahni chu a lo hmuak a. Tin, Joaba chuan indona thuamhnaw a inbel a; tin, a chungah chuan khandaih a pai chawpin kâwnghrênah a pai a; tin, a kal zâwngin a dawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan Amasa hnênah chuan, “Unaupa, i ṭha rih alâwm maw?” a ti a. Tin, Joaba chuan Amasa chu fawh tumin a khabe hmul chu a kut ding lamin a chelh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, Amasa chuan Joaban khandaih a ken chu a ngaihsak lo va. Chutichuan, a pumah chuan a vit a, a rilte chu a tithla nuaih mai a, a vit nawn leh ta lo va; tichuan, a thi ta a. Tichuan, Joaba leh a unaupa Abisaia chuan Bikria fapa Seba chu an ûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a kiangah Joaba hote zînga tlangvâl pakhat chu a ding a, “Joaba lama ṭang leh Davida lama ṭang apiang chuan Joaba zui zêl rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Amasa chu lamlian lai takah a thiin a lo bual nuaih mai a. Tin, chu mi chuan mi zawng zawng ding renga a hmuh chuan Amasa ruang chu lamlian ata phûl lamah sawnin puanin a khuh a, a kianga lo kal apiang an ding zêla a hmuh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, lamlian ata dah sawn a nih hnu chuan Bikria fapa Seba ûm tûrin mi zawng zawngin Joaba chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seba chuan Abel thleng leh Beth-maaka thlengin Israel hnam tin chu a tlawh vek a, Ber mite pawh a tlawh a; tichuan, mite chu an pung khâwm a, amah an zui ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Beth-maaka-ah chuan an rawn hual a; tin, a khaw hrûlah lei an tiang pâwng a, kulh hrûlah chuan an ding a. Tin, Joaba hnêna mi awm zawng zawngte chuan tichim tûrin kulh chu an chhu bur bur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmeichhe fing pakhat khua aṭang chuan a lo au va, “Khai khai! Joaba hnênah, ‘Lo kal hnai rawh, i hnênah thu ka lo sawi teh ang,’ a ti, han ti rawh u khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah chuan a va kal hnai a; tin, hmeichhia chuan, “Joaba i ni em?” a ti a. “Ni e,” a ti a, a chhâng a. Chutichuan, a hnênah, “I bâwihnu thusawi hi ngaithla teh,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Ka ngaithla e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, “Hmânlai chuan, ‘Abel khuaah hian an inrâwn phawt ang,’ an ti ṭhîn a; chutiang chuan thu an titâwp ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei hi Israel zînga inrem duh leh rinawm pâwla mi ka ni a. Nang chuan Israel khua, a khaw bulpui hi tihchhiat i tum a nih hi. Lalpa ro chu engah nge tihmang i tum?” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan a chhâng a, “Chutiang a ni awzâwng lo ve, tihmang emaw, tihchhiat emaw ka tum lo rêng rêng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutiang lam thu chu a ni lo ve. Ephraim tlâng rama mi Bikria fapa a hming Seba chuan lal dodâlin, Davida ngei dodâlin a kut a lek a; amah chu min pe mai ula, khua chu ka chhuahsan mai ang e,” a ti a. Tin, hmeichhia chuan Joaba hnênah, “Ngai teh, a lu chu kulhah kan rawn paih liamsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmeichhia chu a finna thawhin mipui zawng zawngte zîngah chuan a kal a. Tin, Bikria fapa Seba lû chu an tan a, Joaba hnên lamah chuan an theh chhuak a. Tin, tawtawrâwt a hâm a, mahni puan in lam ṭheuhvah khua ata chu an darh ta a. Tin, Joaba chu Jerusalem-ah lal hnênah chuan a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joaba chu Israel sipai zawng zawng hotu a ni a; Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu Kereth mi leh Peleth mite hotu a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Adorama chu hnathawka rawih luihte hotu a ni a; Ahiluda fapa Jehosaphata chu chanchin ziaktu a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Seva chu lehkhaziaktu a ni a; Zadoka leh Abiathara chu puithiam an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tin, Jair mi Ira pawh chu Davida puithiam a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida dam laiin a kum zâwnin kum thum ṭâm a tla a; tin, Davida chuan Lalpa chu a râwn a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Saula leh a chhûngte, thisen chhuahtute vâng a ni e, Gibeon mite a that mai si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Gibeon mite chu a ko va (Gibeon mite chu Israela thlahte an ni lo va, Amor mi la awm chhunte kha an ni zâwk a; Israel thlahte chuan an lakah chhia an lo chham tawh a; Saula chuan Israela thlahte leh Juda thlahte tâna ṭhahnem a ngaih avângin thah a tum ṭhîn mai a ni);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan Gibeon mite hnênah chuan, “Eng nge ka tihsak ang che u? Lalpa ro chu mal in sâwm theih nân eng anga inremna nge ka siam ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Gibeon mite chuan a hnênah, “Saula leh a chhûngte nêna kan chung thûah hian tangkarua leh rangkachak lam thu a ni lo va, Israel zîngah hian mi tihhlum theihna kan nei hek lo,” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “In sawi ang apiang chu ka tihsak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lal hnênah chuan, “Mi tiboraltu leh Israel ram chhûngah rêng rêng awm lova tiboral tûra mi phiartu chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a fapa pasarihte min pe la, Lalpa mi ruat Saula awmna Gibea khuaah chuan Lalpa hmaah kan khai hlum ang e,” an ti a. Tin, lal chuan, “Pe ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, lal chuan Lalpa hnêna Davida leh Saula fapa Jonathana kâra, an pahniha kâra chhechhamna avângin Saula fapa Jonathana fapa Mephibosetha chu a hum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chuan Aii fanu Rizpiin Saula fapa pahnih a hrinsak Armonia leh Mephibosetha erawh chu a hruai a; tin, Meholath mi Barzilaia fapa Adriela, Saula fanu Mikalin fapa panga a hrinsakte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, Gibeon mite kutah chuan a hlân a; tin, anni chuan Lalpa hmaah tlângah an khai hlum a. Tichuan, an pasarih chuan hmun khatah an thi za a, buh seng hun, barli seng ṭan tirh lai vêlin an tihlum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Aii fanu Rizpi chuan saiip puan a la a, buh seng tirh ata vân aṭanga ruahin a rawn nan thlenga a awm nân lungpui chungah a inzâr a; an chunga chhûna chunglêng savate fûk leh zâna ramsate awm pawh a phal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Aii fanu, Saula hmeinu Rizpi thiltih chu Davida an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a kal a, Philistia miten Gilboa-a Saula an thah nia Philistia miten Beth-san mual laia an khai rutu, Jabes-gilead mite hnên ata Saula ruh leh a fapa Jonathana ruhte chu a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuta Saula ruhte leh a fapa Jonathana ruhte chu a la chho va; tichuan, an khaiate ruh chu an la khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Saula ruhte leh a fapa Jonathana ruhte chu Benjamin rama Zela khuaa a pa Kisa thlânah an phûm a. Tichuan, lal thupêk ang zêlin an ti a. Tin, chumi hnuah chuan chumi ram chungah chuan Pathian a lungawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chuan Israel mite chu an do leh a, Davida chu a mite nên an chhuk a, Philistia mite chu an zu bei a; tin, Davida chu a chau ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Isbi-benoba, mi lian fapate zînga mi, a fei rih lam dâr sekel zathum, ngûnhnâm thar pai chuan Davida chu thah a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, Zeruii fapa Abisaian a chhan a, Philistia mi chu a bei a, a that ta a. Tin, Davida mite chuan, “Israel-te khâwnvâr i tihmih loh nân, indo tûrin kan hnênah i chhuak ve tawh hauh lo vang,” tiin a lakah chhia an chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chumi hnuah chuan Philistia mite nên Gob khuaah indona a awm leh a. Chutichuan, Husath mi Sibekaia chuan mi lian fapate zînga mi Sapha a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite nên Gob khuaah an indo leh a; tin, Bethlehem mi Jaare-oregima fapa Elhananan Git mi Goliatha a that a, a fei ngul chu themkawl ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Gath khuaah indona a awm leh a, chutah chuan mi sâng tak mai, a kut lehlam lehlama zungṭang paruk, a ke lehlam lehlama zungṭang paruk, a vaia sawmhnih leh pali nei hi a awm a; ani pawh mi lian laka piang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chu a va cho va, Davida unau Simeia fapa Jonathana chuan a lo that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chûng palite chu Gath khuaah mi lian laka piang an ni a, chûng chu Davida leh a mite kutah an thi a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hmêlma zawng zawng kut ata leh Saula kut ata Lalpan a chhan chhuah ni chuan, he hla thu hi Lalpa hnênah a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan, “ Lalpa chu ka lungpui leh ka kulhpui leh mi chhanhimtu a ni a, ka ta ngei a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lungpui Pathian, amah chu ka ring ang; Ka phaw leh ka chhandamna ki, ka kulhbîng sâng leh ka inhumhimna a ni; Ka chhandamtu, nangin pâwngnawrna lak ata mi chhandam ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Fak tlâk Lalpa chu ka ko vang a; Chutichuan, mi dotute lakah chhandamin ka awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thihna fâwn chuan min hual vêl a, Pathian ngaihsak lohna tui lian chuan mi tihlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seol hruihrualte chuan mi phuar vêl a; Thihna thangte chuan mi âwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka manganin Lalpa chu ka ko ṭhîn a, A ni, ka Pathian chu ka au ṭhîn; Ani chuan a biak in aṭang chuan ka aw a hria a; Tin, ka au thâwm chu a bengah a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu veleh lei hi a nghîng a, a khûr ta a. A thinur avângin vân innghahnate lamin a khûrin a nghîng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hnâr aṭang chuan meikhu a chho ta ngut ngut a, A kâa chhuak mei chuan a kâng ta hluah hluah a; Chu chuan meihawl pawh a tialh ta dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan vânte pawh a tikûn a, a chhuk ta a; A ke hnuaiahte chuan thim chhah mup hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherub chungah a chuang a, a thlâwk ta a; A ni, thli thlaahte chuan an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thim chu amah hual vêlna bûktêah a siam a, Tuite, vâna chhûm chhah mupte chu fâwk khâwmin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hmaa ênna avâng chuan meilingte chu a alh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chu vânah khian a lo ri dur dur a, Chungnungbera chuan a aw a chhuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, thalte chu a kâp chhuak a, anniho chu a tidarh a; Kâwl te a phêttîr a, a tibuai ta nuaih hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu veleh Lalpa zilhhauna avânga, A hnâra thaw chhuakin a chhêm vak avâng chuan, Leilung nghahchhante chu tihlanin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan chung lam aṭangin a rawn ban a, mi chelh a; Tui tam tak ata mi hnûk chhuak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi dotu chak tak lakah chuan mi chhan him a, Mi hawtute lakah pawh; keia tân chuan an chak lutuk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chuan ka vânduai ni chuan mi bei a; Nimahsela, Lalpa chu ka innghahna ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan hmun thâwl takah mi hruai chhuak a; Ka chunga a lâwm avângin mi chhan him ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka felzia ang zêlin ka chungah a ti a; Ka kutte a thianghlimzia ang ngeiin mi rûl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa kawngte chu ka zawh a, Ka Pathian hnên ata chu sual takin ka kal bo ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A rorêlna zawng zawng chu ka hmaah a awm ṭhîn a; A thuruatte lah chu ka hawisan ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama lakah chuan sawisêl bo ka ni bawk a, Ka khawlohna ata ka inthiarfihlîm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan ka felzia ang zêlin mi lo rûl ta a; A mit hmuha ka thianghlimzia ang zêlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi khawngaih thei tak lakah chuan khawngaih thei takin i intilang ang a, Mi ṭha famkim lakah chuan ṭha famkimin i intilang ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi thianghlim lakah chuan thianghlimin i intilang ang a; Tin, mi luhlul lakah chuan luhlulin i intilang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hrehawm tuar mite chu i chhandam ang a; Mi chapote erawh chu i tihtlâwm theih nân an chungah i mit a fu reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka khâwnvâr i ni si a; Lalpa chuan ka thimna hi a tiêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangma ṭanpuiin râl ka bawh si a; Ka Pathian ṭanpui bawkin kulh ka zuan khûm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian zawng a kawng chu a ṭha famkim a; Lalpa thu chu fiah a ni tawh; Amah ringtu zawng zawngte tân chuan ani chu phaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lalpa lo chu tu nge Pathian awm ni? Kan Pathian lo chu tu nge lungpui awm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian chu ka kulhpui nghet tak a ni a, Ka kawng a tiṭha famkim ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka kete chu zukpui ke angin a siam a, Ka hmun sângahte mi awmtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka kutte hi râl kâp tûrin a zirtîr ṭhîn a; Chutichuan, ka bânte hian dâr thal ngul a kuai zo hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nangin i chhandamna phaw chu mi pe bawk a; I inngaihtlâwmnain mi siam lian ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka hnuaia ka ke pênna chu i tizau va; Tichuan, ka kete hi a tleng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mi dotute chu ka ûm pha a, ka tiboral a; Tihboral dêra an awm hma loh chuan ka kîr hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An thawh leh theih lohna tûrin ka tiboral dêr a, ka sât chhawk a; A ni, ka ke hnuaiah an tlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangin inbeihna atân chuan chaknain ka taiah mi hrêng si a; Mi rawn beitute chu ka hnuaiah i tudawl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mi hawtute chu ka tihboral theihna tûrin, Nangin mi dotute chu mi hnuchhawnin i awmtîr ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An hawi vêl a; nimahsela, chhandamtu tûr tu mah an awm lo va; Lalpa ngei chu an han en a; nimahsela, a chhâng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chu veleh leia vaivut ang maiin ka vaw sawm dep a; Kawtlai chirhdiak ang maiin ka tipherh a, ka theh darh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nangin ka mite sualna lakah pawh mi chhan him ta a; Hnam tin lû ni tûrin mi vawng ṭha a. Ka hriat ngai loh hnam chuan ka rawng an bâwl tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hnam dangte chu ka hnênah an inpe ang a; Ka chanchin an hriat veleh ka thu an zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hnam dangte chu an chuai ang a, An kulhbîng atate chu khûr chungin an lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Lalpa chu a nung reng e! Ka Lungpui chu fakin awm sela! Mi chhandamna Lungpui, Pathian chu chawimawiin awm rawh se!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Phuba mi lâksaktu leh Hnam tin ka hnuaia tudawltu Pathian ngei chu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mi dotute lak ata mi la chhuak a. A ni, nangin mi beitute chung lamah chuan mi chawi kâng a; Mi nunrâwng lak ata chu mi chhan him ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Lalpa , hnam tin zîngah chuan lâwmthu ka hrilh ang chia, I hming fakin ka zai bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ani chuan chhandamna ropui tak a lal a pe thîn a; A hriak thiha chungah, Davida leh a thlahte chung ngeiah chuan, Kumkhuain a ngilneihzia a lantîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêng hi Davida thusawi hnuhnûng ber a ni. Jesaia fapa Davida, Sâng taka chawi sâna, Jakoba Pathian hriak thiha, Israel-te hla mawi tak phuahtu chuan a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa thlarau chuan keimah mi hmangin a sawi a, A thu chu ka leiah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian chuan a sawi a, Israel-te Lungpui chuan: ‘Mi chunga fel taka rorêl ṭhîna chu, Pathian ṭih chunga rorêl ṭhîna chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni a lo chhuaha chhûm awm hauh lo zîng êng ang hi a ni ang a, Ruah sûr hnua khaw lo thianga, Leia hlobet chawr no dep ang hi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ ‘Kan chhûngkua chu Pathian hnêna mi a ni lâwm ni? Chatuan thuthlung chu ka hnênah a thlung a, engkim fel leh tinghet tlatin. Ka chhandamna kim leh duhthusâm kim, a chawr chhuahtîr lâwng maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi suaksualte erawh chu an zain a hnâwla hnâwl bo mi, Hlîng ang an ni ang a, kuta lâk mi an ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khawihtu tûr chuan thîr leh fei ngul rawih zâwk tûr a ni a; Tichuan, an hmunah hâl ral vek an ni ang,’ tiin mi bia a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hêng hi Davida sipai huaisen hmingte chu a ni: Takemon mi Josebasebetha chu sipai hotute zînga hotu ber a ni a; ani chu ṭum khata mi zariat thattu Eznit mi Adinoa an tih bawk kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a dawttu chu Aho mi Dodova fapa Eleazara a ni a; chu mi chu Philistia mite indo tûra an pun khâwma, an chova, Israel mite an kal bo vek laia Davida hnêna sipai huaisen pathumte zînga pakhat kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chu a tho va, Philistia mite chu a kut a khama a khandaih pawh thlah thei lo hial khawpin a that a. Chumi ni chuan Lalpan nasa takin a ngamsak a; tin, mipuite chu a hnungah râllâk thil la tûr ngawtin an lo kîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chumi dawttu chu Harar mi Agea fapa Samma a ni a. Tin, dailuah awm chûkna hmunah Philistia mite chu lâk tumin an infâwk khâwm a; tin, mipuite chuan Philistia mite chu an tlânchhiatsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu chumi hmunah chuan a ding a, a vêng tlat a, Philistia mite chu a that a; tin, Lalpan nasa takin a ngamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, sipai huai huai sawmthum zînga pathumte chu an chhuk a, buh seng lai takin Davida hnênah Adulam pûkah an kal a; tin, Philistia sipaiho chuan Rephaim kâwnah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chutih lai chuan Davida chu kulhbîngah a awm a, chutih lai bawk chuan Philistia sipaiho chu Bethlehem-ah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan tui a châk êm êm mai a, “Bethlehem-a tuichhunchhuah tui, kulh kawngkhâr kianga mi kha in tûra mi pe han awm teh sela aw!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, sipai huaisen pathumte chuan Philistia sipaiho chu an tâwn tlang a, kulh kawngkhâr kianga mi Bethlehem-a tuichhunchhuah tui chu an va chawi a, an keng a, Davida hnênah an kalpui a; nimahsela, a lo in duh lo va, Lalpa tân a bun chhuak ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , hei hi ka tih loh tûrzia mai chu! Thih huama kalte thisen chu ka in dâwn em ni?” a ti a; chutichuan, a in duh ta lo va. Chûng thilte chu sipai huaisen pathumte chuan an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba unau Abisaia chu an pathum zînga hotu ber a ni a. A feiin mi zathum a bei a, a that a, pathumte zîngah chuan hmingṭhat a hlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathumte zîngah chuan chawimawi tlâk ber a ni lâwm ni? Chuvângin, an hotu atân an siam a; nimahsela, chungnung ber pathum zînga chhiar tel a kai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Kebzeel mi huai fapa Jehoiada fapa Benaia, thil nasa tak titu chuan Moab mi huaisen Ariela fapate pahnih a that a; tin, a zuk chhuk a, vûr tlâk hun laiin khuarkhurumah sakeibaknei a zuk that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mi, mi lian tak a that a. Aigupta mi chuan fei a keng a; nimahsela, Benaia chuan tiang kengin a zuk pan a, Aigupta mi fei ken chu a chhuhsak a, ama fei chuan a chhun hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chuan chutiang thil chu a tih avângin sipai huaisen pathumte zîngah chuan hmingṭhat a hlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi sawmthumte ai chuan chawimawi tlâk a ni a; nimahsela, chungnung ber pathumte zînga chhiar tel a kai lo. Tin, Davida chuan amah vêngtu hotu atân a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joaba unau Asahela chu sawmthum zînga pakhat a ni a; Bethlehem khuaa mi Dodova fapa Elhanana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Harod mi Sama te, Harod mi Elika te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pal mi Heleza te, Teko mi Ikesa fapa Ira te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth mi Abiezera te, Husath mi Mebunaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aho mi Zalmona te, Netophath mi Maharaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Netophath mi Baana fapa Heleba te, Benjamina thlah Gibea khuaa mi Ribaia fapa Ithaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pirathon mi Benaia te, Gaas-a luitea mi Hidaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Arbath mi Abi-albona te, Bahurim mi Azmavetha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Saalbon mi Eliaba te, Jasena fapate zînga Jonathana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Harar mi Sama te, Harar mi Sarara fapa Ahiama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Maakath mi Ahasbaia fapa Elipheleta te, Gilon mi Ahithophela fapa Eliama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Karmel mi Hezraia te, Arbit mi Paaraia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zoba khuaa mi Nathana fapa Igala te, Gad mi Bania te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba râlthuam kengtu Amon mi Zeleka te, Beerot mi Naharaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />It mi Ira te, It mi Gareba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hit mi Uria te an ni: an za chuan sawmthum leh pasarih an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thinurna chu Israel-te chungah a lo thawk leh ta thut a, “Kal la, Israel mi leh Juda mite chhiar vek rawh,” tiin, Davida chu an pawi khawih tûrin a chawk tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnêna awm sipai hotu Joaba hnênah chuan, “Israel hnam zawng zawng zîngah hian Dan aṭanga Beer-seba thlengin vâk vêl la, mi eng zât nge an nih ka hriat theih nân chhiar vek rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan lal hnênah, “Lalpa i Pathian chuan mipuite tipungin, eng zâta tam pawh, a leh za pawh lalpa ka pu hian hmu hman rawh se; nimahsela, lalpa ka pu chuan chu chu engah nge maw hriat a châk le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, lal thu chuan Joaba leh sipai hotute chu a hneh ta a. Tichuan, Joaba leh sipai hotute chu Israel mite chhiar tûr chuan lal hnên ata chu an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jordan râl an va kai a; tin, Gad ruam lai tak ding lama khaw awm Aroer-ah chuan Jazer thlengin awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Gilead ram leh Tahtim-hodsi ram an thleng a; tin, Dan-jaan an thleng a, Zidon panin an kal vel a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, Tura kulh te an va thleng a; tin, Hiv-ho leh Kanaan mite khua zawng zawng an thleng a; tin, Judai chhim lam Beer-seba-ah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, ram zawng zawng an fan chhuah hnu chuan thla kua leh ni sawmhnih ralah Jerusalem-ah an lo haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan mihring zât chin chu lal a pe a. Tin, Israel ramah chuan khandaih keng mi, mi huaisen nuai riat an awm a; tin, Juda mi chu nuai nga an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mihring a han chhiar zawh chuan Davida thinlung chu a na ta hle mai a. Tin, Davida chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Ka thiltihah hian nasa takin ka lo sual ta a ni; nimahsela, tûnah hian aw Lalpa , i chhiahhlawh khawlohna hi dah bo tûrin ka ngên a che; âtthlâk takin ka lo ti ta a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, zînga Davida a han thawh chuan Davida zâwlnei, zâwlnei Gada hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kal la, Davida hnênah, ‘ Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Thil kawng thum ka ruatsak chia, i chunga ka tih tûrin pakhat thlang rawh,” a ti e,’” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Gada chu Davida hnênah a kal a, a hrilh a, a hnênah, “I ramah hian kum sarih ṭâm i chunga a lo tlâk nge, i hmêlma hmaa an ûm chhûng chea thla thum lo tlân bo rih nge, i rama ni thum hri lo lên? Mi tîrtu eng angin nge ka chhân dâwn inngaihtuah la, mi hrilh rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Gada hnênah, “Ka mang a ang hle mai. Lalpa kutah tlu lût phawt mai ila, a zahngaihna chu a nasa hle si a; mihring kutah chuan mi tlûk luhtîr lul suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chuan Israel mite chungah chuan zîng aṭangin hun ruat ang thleng chuan hri a lêntîr a; tichuan, mipui zînga mi chu Dan aṭangin Beer-seba thlengin mi sîngsarih an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkohvin tichhe tûra Jerusalem lama a kut a han lek chuan, Lalpan thil ṭha lo tih a tum chu a lamlêt a, mite tiboraltu vântirhkoh hnênah chuan, “A tâwk tawh e; i kut lek tawh suh,” a ti a. Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu Jebus mi Arauna hruih bulah chuan a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Davidan mi tihlumtu vântirhkoh a hmuh chuan Lalpa a bia a, “Ngai teh, ka lo sual ta a, dik lo takin thil ka lo ti ta a ni; mahse, hêng berâmte hian eng thil nge an tih? I kut chuan keimah leh ka pa chhûngte mi khawih zâwk rawh se aw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan Gada chu Davida hnênah a kal a, a hnênah, “Chho la, Jebus mi Arauna hruihah Lalpa tân maichâm han siam rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu Lalpan thu a pêk anga Gadan a hrilh ang chuan a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Arauna chu a han hawi a, a lam pana lal leh a hote lo kal chu a hmu a. Tichuan, Arauna chu a chhuak a, a hmaia lei siin lal hmaah chuan a bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Arauna chuan, “Eng vângin nge lalpa ka pu chu a chhiahhlawh hnênah a lo kal le?” a ti a. Tin, Davida chuan, “Mipuite laka hri a kian theihna tûra Lalpa tâna maichâm siam nâna i hruih lei tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Arauna chuan Davida hnênah, “ Lalpa ka pu chuan âwm a tih chu la sela, hlân ang hmiang. En teh, hâlrala hlan atân bâwngpate chu a awm a; tin, thing atân hruih hmanruate leh sebâwng thuamnate chu a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw lalpa, hêng zawng zawng hi Arauna chuan lal a pe vek e,” a ti a. Tin, Arauna chuan lal hnênah, “ Lalpa i Pathian chuan lo chhâng che rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Arauna hnênah, “Ni lo ve a, man neiin a lei ngeiin ka leisak zâwk ang che; eng mah insêngso lovin Lalpa ka Pathian hnênah hâlral thilhlante ka hlân tawp lo vang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Davida chuan hruih leh sebâwngpate chu tangka sekel sawmngain a lei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Davidan chutah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a, hâlral thilhlante leh remna thilhlante a hlân a. Chutichuan, Lalpa chu an ram chungah chuan a lungawi a, Israel ram ata hri chu a kiang ta a.
  </para>
</usx>
